<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">Kumpite Niina</book>
  <para style="h">Kumpite Niina</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kumpite Niina</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kumpite Niina</para>
  <para style="mt">Kumpite Niina</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Ahab thi zawkciang Moab ngam in Israel langpanin leedo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Ahaziah sia ama ii Samaria kumpi inn tung dawl thaam tung panin taak a, nasia takin liam hi. Tua ahikom ama in Philistine khuapi Ekron ah kamtai paisak a, a dam kik tu le a dam nawn ngawl tu Philistine te pathian Baalzebub donghsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang Topa ii vantunglalang khat in Tishbe pan kamsaang Elijah sia Kumpipa Ahaziah ii kamtaite taw kisi tu in paisak a, “Banghangin Ekron pathian Baalzebub tungah thu dongh tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel ngam ah pathian om ngawl hi ci in na ngaisut uh hang ziam ci in amate donghsak hi. Topa in, ‘Na liamna pan dam kik ngawl tu ni hi; thi tu ni hi hong ci hi!’ ci in kumpipa tungah son in,” ci hi. Elijah in Topa thupiak bangin ngamta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuaciang kamtaite kumpipa kungah heak kik uh hi. “Banghangin hong heak kik nu ziam?” ci in ama in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in, “Pasal khat taw ka kisik uh ciang, ama in heak kik in hong sawl a, Topa ii nang tungah, ‘Banghangin Ekron pathian Baalzebub kungah thu dongh tu in kamtaite paisak ni ziam? Israel ngam ah pathian om ngawl hi, ci in ngaisun ni ziam? Na liamna pan dam kik ngawl tu ni hi, thi tu ni hi!’ ” hong ci teng sonin hong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Pasal pa ii pianzia bangbang ahi ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ama in nganhing phaw taw a kivawt puantual khat silh a, tuaciang savun kawngkhau taw sawm hi,” ci in amate in zo hi. “Ama Elijah hi!” kumpi pa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in ulian khat le pasal 50 sia Elijah sam tu in paisak hi. A ulian pa in ama mualtung khat ah to in mu a, ama munah, “Pathian ii mipa awng, kumpipa in nong paisuk natu thu hong pia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Elijah in, “Kei Pathian ii mi ka hi le van panin meikuang hong paisuk tahen a, nang le na mite hong thatlum tahen!” ci in zo hi. Thakhat thu in meikuang hong pai suk a, ulian pa le a mite thatlum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa in ulian dang khat le pasal sawmnga sawl kik a, amate paito in, Elijah munah, “Pathian ii mipa awng, kumpipa in thakhatin nong paisuk natu thu hong pia hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Kei, Pathian ii mi ka hile, vantung panin meikuang hong paisuk tahen a, nang le na mite hong thatlum tahen,” ci in Elijah in zo hi. Thakhat thu in Pathian ii meikuang hong paisuk a ulian pa le a mite thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khatvei ma kumpipa in ulian khat le mihing sawmnga sawl hi. Ama mual tungah kaato in, Elijah mai ah khupdinin, “Pathian ii mipa awng, kei le ka mite hong hesuak ta'n. Ka nuntakna uh hong khoaikhe ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ulian dangte nii le a mite sia vantung pan meikuang in thatlum siat hi; ahizong kei ka hile hong hesuak ta'n!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa ii vantunglalang in Elijah munah, “Ama taw paisuk ta'n a, lau heak in,” ci hi. Tua ahikom Elijah sia ulianpa taw kumpipa kungah pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ama munah, “ Topa in hi bangin ci hi: ‘Israel ngam ah thudok tu pathian om ngawl bang keak in — Ekron te ii pathian Baalzebub kungah kamtaite paisak na hikom — nang dam kik ngawl tu ni hi; thi tu ni hi!’ ” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa ii Elijah tungtawnin a son bangma Ahaziah thi hi. Ahaziah in tapa nei ngawl hi, tua ahikom a suapuipa Joram in a kumpiza laih a, tua laitak sia Judah kumpipa, Jehoshaphat ii tapa Jehoram ii maan zawk a kum niina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahaziah ii sep le vawt dang theampo sia Israel Kumpite Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elijah sia suumpei taw vantung ah Topa ii a laakto tu hun hong theng hi. Elijah le Elisha sia Gilgal panin vaiding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuaciang, a lampai kawmin Elijah in Elisha tungah, “Tu in hi sungah na om in; Topa in Bethel ah pai in hong sawl hi,” ci hi. Ahihang Elisha in, “Nang hong nusia ngawl tu khi hi, ci in a nungta Topa tung le nang tungah ka thumaanna taw kiciam khi hi,” ci in zo hi. Tua ahikom amate Bethel ah paisuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua munah a teang kamsaang honkhat in Elisha kungah pai in, “ Topa in na topa sia tu ni in nang kung pan la tu ahi hunlam na he ziam?” ci in dongh uh hi. Elisha in, “Hi hi, he khi hi. Ahihang tua thu son bua tawng,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Elijah in Elisha munah, “Tu in hi sungah na om in; Topa in Jericho khua ah pai in hong sawl zo hi,” ci hi. Ahihang Elisha in, “Nang hong nusia ngawl tu khi hi, ci in a nungta Topa tung le nang tungah ka thumaanna taw kiciam khi hi,” ci in zo hi. Tua ahikom amate Jericho ah paisuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua munah a teang kamsaang honkhat in Elisha kungah pai in, “ Topa in tu ni in na topa nang kung pan la tu ahi na he ziam?” ci in ama dongh uh hi. Elisha in, “Hi hi, he khi hi. Ahihang tua thu son bua tawng,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuasia zawkciang Elijah in Elisha munah, “Tu in hi sungah na om in; Topa in kei Jordan ngun ah pai in hong sawl hi,” ci hi. Ahihang Elisha in, “Nang hong nusia ngawl tu khi hi, ci in a nungta Topa tung le nang tungah ka thumaanna taw kiciam khi hi,” ci hi. Tua ahikom amate paisuak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />kamsaangte sung pan 50 in amate Jordan dong zui uh hi. Elijah le Elisha te ngun hui ah tawlnga in, a kamsaang 50 teng sia tawm a kikhuala na ah ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang Elijah in a puantual suutin, a zial zawkciang tui saatna in nei hi; tui hong kikhen a, ama le Elisha in a langkhat ah leiko tung tawnin kaantan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaciang, Elijah in Elisha munah, “Kei hong kilaak ma in nang atu bang kong vawtsak tu dei ni ziam hong son ta'n,” ci hi. Elisha in, “Na zaa kong laih thei natu in na vaangletna tel ka saan tu za (a zaa nii ) hong ngasak ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Elijah in, “Tuasia piak tu a haksa mama ngetna hi,” ci in zo kik hi. “Ahihang nang kung panin kei hong kilaak nong mu le, tua ngetna sia na nga tu hi; nong mu buale na nga buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate lam a pai kawmin thu son uh hi; tuaciang thakhat thu in meikuang siphute ii kai meikuang siphu ngalleang khat amate nii kilaklaw ah hong pai a, Elijah sia vantung ah suumpei in kaato pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elisha in mu in, Elijah oksan a, “Ka pa, ka pa! Israel a dal a thahat pa! Nang pai zo hi teh!” ci hi. Tuaciang ama in Elijah mu kik nawn ngawl hi. Elisha khuangai in a puantual eau a khen nii sua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaciang hong taaksuk Elijah ii puantual sia tawm in hong heak kik a, Jordan ngun vaal ah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in nguntui sia Elijah ii puantual taw vaat a, “Elijah ii Pathian Topa a koi sungah om ziam?” ci hi. Tuaciang ama in tui vaat kik in, tui hong kikhen a, ngun langkhat ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jericho pan kamsaang 50 teng in ama mu a, “Elijah ii vaangletna Elisha tungah om hi!” ci uh hi. Amate pai a, ama taw kisi in, a mai ah kun uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuaciang, “Hi sungah a thahat tingtengh pasal sawmnga om khu hi. Na topa zong tu in pai tek tawng. Topa ii thaa in ama paipui a, mualtung khat, luam sung khat po ah nusia hi tha tu hi,” ci uh hi. Elisha in, “Hi ngawl hi. Pai ngawl het tu nu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang amate a thukim dawdong a nget uh ciang paisak hi. Sawmnga teng in mun saang mun niamna ah Elijah sia ni thum sung zong ahihang mu ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaciang Jericho ah amate ngakin a om Elisha kungah hong heak kik ciang, ama in, “Pai heak vun kong ci ma hi ngawl ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jericho panin pasal pawlkhat Elisha kungah pai a, “Na heak bangma, topa awng, hisia in khuapi pha khat hi, ahihang a tui pha ngawl a, nau tolsak thei hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in, “Kuang thak khat sungah ci tawm hong paipui tavun,” ci in thupia hi. Amate in ama kungah tuasia paipui uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuaciang ama in cik ah pai in, tui sungah a ci lawn a, “Hisia Topa ii kammal hi: ‘Tui hisia thiangthosak khi hi, tua tui in thina ahizong, nautolna ahizong piangsak nawn ngawl tu hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaciang tua tui Elisha ii son bangma in tua hun pan kipan thiangtho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Elisha in Jericho nusia in Bethel ah a pai le, patang pawlkhat khua khat panin hong pusuak in, ama ciammuina in nei a, “Hi sung pan tai in, lutol pa awng,” ci in oksan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Elisha hong kingeilee in, amate salh a, Topa min taw haamsiat hi. Tua zawkciang vompui nii duisung pan hong pai in, patangte sung pan 42 laaitham uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Elisha Carmel Mual ah kaato a, tua zawkciang Samaria ah heak kik hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Jehoshaphat a maan zawk a kum sawm le liat laitakin, Ahab ii tapa Joram sia Israel kumpipa suak a, tuaciang ama in Samaria panin kum sawm le kum nii sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama sia Topa tungah mawna vawt a, ahizong a pa ahibuale a nu Jezebel za in sia ngawl hi; ama in a pa ii vawt Baal biak natu milim sia kaivawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahizong, ama mai ah a maang Nebat ii tapa, Kumpipa Jeroboam bangma in mawna sungah Israel lampui a, kheal nuam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab Kumpipa Mesha in tuu khoai a, kum simin Israel kumpipa tungah tuuno 100,000 le tuu 100,000 ii mul teng shia in pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang Israel kumpipa Ahab a thi ciang Kumpipa Mesha in Israel te langpanin leedo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thakhat thu in Kumpipa Joram in Samaria nusia in a ngalkapte khawmtua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in Judah kumpipa Jehoshaphat tungah kam thaak a: “Moab kumpipa in kei langpanin hong leedo hi; ama sim tu in kei nong pawm tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Kumpipa Jehoshaphat in, “Hong pawm tu khi hi,” ci in zo hi. “Keima, ka mite le ka siphute, na dei babangin zeak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama ih sim natu koisung lampi tawn tu hi ziam?” ci hi. “Edom duisung kaantan in a pai lam sau sia ih tawn tu hi,” ci in Joram in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom Kumpipa Joram, Judah le Edom kumpipate ngamkuan uh hi. Ni sali a pai zawk uh ciang a tui neak tu uh bo a, mihingte atu ahizong, vanh pua ngannote atu ahizong bangma om nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa Jehoshaphat in, “Man sa hi hing!” ci hi. “ Topa in ei teng thum sia Moab kumpipa ii a uuk po hong vawt tu in hong koi hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa Jehoshaphat in, “Ama tungtawnin Topa ih dok thei tu hi sungah kamsaang khat om hi ngawl ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Kumpipa Joram ii ngalkap bu khat in, “Shaphat ii tapa Elisha hi sungah om hi. Ama sia Elijah ii khutdawn pa ahi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpipa Jehoshaphat in, “Ama sia kamsaang maan khat hi,” ci hi. Tua ahikom kumpipate thum sia Elisha kungah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elisha in Israel kumpipa munah, “Banghangin nang hong hu tu khi ziam?” ci hi. “Na pa le na nu ii thudok tua kamsaangte dongh tu in va pai ta'n,” ci hi. Joram in, “Hi ngawl hi, Topa in ko kumpi thum teng sia Moab kumpipa ii a uuk po hong law tu in hong koi sa hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elisha in, “A na ka sepsak a nungta Topa taw kiciam khi hi, na kipawl puipa Judah kumpipa Jehoshaphat ka zatak hang hi buale nang taw bangma kipee-aw nuam ngawl khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu in music thiam khat hong sam tavun,” ci in zo hi. Music thiampa in a tengtongh hong tum tak ciang Topa ii vaangletna Elisha tungah hong pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuaciang, ama in, “Hi sia Topa pauna hi: ‘Hi luamko dung theampo ah dum to vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vui ahizong ngua ahizong na mu mun uh a om ngawl hang, hi luam sia tui taw kidim tu a, noma, na ngannote uh le na vanh pua ngannote ii dawn tu kicing piikpeak tu hi,’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaciang Elisha in zomto a, “Ahihang hisia in Topa sep tu in a ol mama nasep khat hi; Moab te zongh hong zosak lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Noma in amate ii a hoi mama a kip a kho in a vawt khuapi theampo na zothal tu uh hi; amate ii thingnga kung theampo phuktan in, a tuinaak teng kangsak tu nu hi, tuaciang, leipha a lo teng theampo suang dimsak in, na siasak tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A zing ciang zingsangin, sangaw biakpiakna vawt ngei hun laitakin, Edom sang pan tui hong luang a, lei khuum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua kumpi thum teng amate sim tu in hong pai hunlam Moab te in a zaak uh ciang pa a minpiang ngalhiam toai thei theampo a moibel pan a haambel dong kiko in, ngamngi ah amate panmun la sak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A zing ciang zingsang a thaw uh ciang, tui tungah ni hong taang a, tui sia chi bang a sanin kimusak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Chisan hi!” ci in amate in au uh hi. “Ngalte ngalkaphonpi thum sia amate le amate kido in kithat hi tu hi! A ngiaphual ah pai in phuul tawng,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahihang amate tua ngiaphual a thet uh ciang, Israel te in simin, not kik uh hi. Israel te in del tan in, Moab te that uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />a khuapite lalthamsak uh hi. Leipha lo khat pawpo a kaantan uh ciangin Israel mi simin tua lo sung teng theampo suang a dim dongin suang khat tek lawn uh hi; amate in ciktui naakte zongh kangsak in, thingnga kungte phuk uh hi. A khakbel ciangin Kir Heres khuapi bek taanglai a, tuaciang saili kapte in uumci in sim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Moab kumpipa in a ngallelna a phaw tak ciang ama in namsau zangh thiam mihing 700 taw a ngalte kawm panin Syria kumpipa kungah suatak tu hanciam ahihang, suak zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in ama za laih tu a tapa lianbel sia la in, khuapi luphung tung pan Moab pathian tungah sangaw biakpiakna in pia hi. Israel te sia lau ngawp ahikom tua khuapi pan nungkin in amate ngam ah heak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kamsaang honkhat sung a kihel khat ii zi meingong nu sia Elisha kungah pai in, “Topa awng, ka pasal thi zo hi! Na heak bangma in ama sia Pathian kiita pasal khat hi, ahihang tu in a leibatna pasal khat in, ka pasal ii leiba taangin ka tate nii sila in a la tu hong pai zo hi,” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “Nang atu bang hong vawtsak tu khi ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Inn ah bang nei ni ziam, hong son ta'n,” ci hi. Ama in, “Olive thau thawl khat simngawl a dang nei mama ngawl khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Elisha in, “Na innpaamte kungah va pai ta'n a, bealhawm a tam thei zaza zawng in,” ci in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tua zawkciang nangma le na tapate inn sungah tum in, kongkha khak vun a, bealte ii sungah sathau sung tavun. Khat a dim simin a hui ah heam vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom nupi nu in a tapate taw inn sungah tumin, bangkua a kha zawkciang olive thau a om thawlno sia la in a tapate ii hong paipui bealte sungah sathau sungsuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in bealte a dip siat zawk uh ciang nupi nu in a dang a om lai ziam ci in dongh hi. A tapate khat in, “Tuasia a khakbel hi,” ci in zo hi. Tuasia ciang olive thau luang nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama kamsaangpa Elisha kungah pai kik a, kamsaang pa in ama munah, “Olive thaute zuak tavun a, na leiba theampo lo tavun, tuaciang nang le na tapate kivaak khom natu in sum a khomkhat ma hong vaal lai tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni khat ni in nupi hau khat ii a teenna Shunem khua ah Elisha haw hi. Ama in kamsaang pa an ne tu in sam a, tuasia pan kipan Shunem ah a pai simin ama inn ah an ne hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in a pasal munah, “Hi sungah hong pai tawntung pasal sia mi thiangtho khat hi vangiat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Innkhum tungah inndoino khat vawtsak in, lupna khat, sabuai khat, tokhum khat le meiinn khat tua inndoi sungah koisak tawng, ama hong haw simin tua munah om thei tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni khat ni ciang Elisha sia Shunem ah hong zuan kik a, toitang tu in a inndoi ah kaato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in a naseampa Gehazi sawl in, nupinu samsak hi. Tua nu hong pai ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ama in Gehazi munah, “Ei ii ih kitaangsap teng hong sik natu hong ngim law hu in ama atu bang ka vawtsak thei tu ziam ci in dongh in. Kumpipa tungah ahizong ngalkaphonpi ukpa tungah ahizong ama atu kampha khat po sonsak le hong oai hi tha tu hi,” ci hi. Tua nu in, “Hi sungah ka mite kawmah ka kisap theampo nei khi zam,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elisha in Gehazi munah, “Tua ahile ama atu bang vawtsak thei tu khi ziam?” ci dongh hi. Ama in, “Pha hi, tua nu in tapa nei ngawl a, a pasal le huai zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Elisha in, “Ama hi sungah hong pai natu son in,” ci in thupia hi. Ama hong pai a, bangkua ah hong ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuaciang Elisha in ama munah, “Mai ciang tubang hun in tapa khat na khut sungah toai tu ni hi,” ci hi. Ama in, “Oh! Topa awng nong hesuakna in leilot thu hong son heak in. Nang sia Pathian mihing khat na hi hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang Elisha ii ci bangin a mai kum tua hun khawng ciangin ama in tapa khat hing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kum tawmvei zawkciang anlaak hun laitakin, patangno sia zing khat, a pa kung zuan tu in pusuak hi, a pa sia lo sungah an late taw diang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thakhatin patangno sia in a pa tung ah, “Ka lutang na hi! Ka lutang na hi!” ci hi. A pa in, “Patangno sia a nu kungah na puak ta'n,” ci in naseam khat sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Naseam pa in patangno sia a nu kungah puak kik a, a nu in ni sun dong a kaang sungah toai hi, tua hunsung in a ta thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A nu in patangno sia Elisha ii inndoi ah toai to in lupna tungah sial a nusia hi, tuaciang kongkha khak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in a pasal samin, ama munah, “Naseamte khat hi sungah laa taw hong paisak ta'n. Kamsaang pa Elisha kungah ka pai kul tu hi. A manlang thei belin hong heak kik tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Banghang tu ni na pai kul tu ziam? Tu ni sia Sabbath le hi ngawl Thathak Poai ni le hi ngawl hi,” a pasal in ci hi. Tua nu in, “Pha maw bo,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in laa kungh thuasakin, naseampa tung ah, “Laa sia a manlang thei za in paisak in, keima kong sawl ngawl po haisak heak in,” ci in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuabangin ama vaiding in Elisha ii omna Carmel Mual ah pai hi. Ama ii hong pai sia Elisha in a khuala thithim na pan mu a, a naseampa Gehazi munah, “En in — zia sungah Shunem pan nupinu hong pai hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Manlang in va pai ta'n a, ama ahizong a pasal ahizong a tapa ahizong a dam tek ziam, va dawp ta'n,” ci hi. Nupinu in Gehazi munah na theampo pha hi ci hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ahihang Elisha kung a thet ciang a mai ah kun sukin a peangte pom hi. Gehazi in ama sawn tu in kithoai ahihang Elisha in, “Koi po in. Ama nasia takin a thin hee ahi hunlam mu thei ngawl ni ziam? Tuaciang Topa in a thu khat zong kei hong son ngawl het hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nupi nu in ama tungah, “Topa awng, tapa khat nang tungah hong ngen kana khi ziam? Lametna saangpi ka nei thaak tu in hong hi heak in hong ci hi ka na ngawl khi ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Elisha sia Gehazi sangah kiheakin, ama munah, “Manlang in! Ka ciangkhut la in va pai ta'n. Lampi ah na kisik pui pawpo paupui tu in tawlnga heak in, tuaciang khat po in hong paupui le zong ama na zo kik natu hun bosak heak in. A inn ah tangtan in va pai ta'n a, patangno sia tungah ka ciangkhut va nga ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nupi nu in Elisha munah, “A nungta Topa tung le nang tungah ka thumaanna taw kiciam khi hi, nang hong nusia ngawl tu khi hi!” ci hi. Tua bangin amate nii hong heak kik khawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gehazi sia mai ah paikhol a, Elisha ciangkhut sia patangno ii tungah nga ahihang bangma a nging le om ngawl, nuntakna lim a dang le a om bua hi. Tua ahikom ama Elisha taw kimu tu in hong pai kik a, tuaciang, “Patangno sia khanglo ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Elisha hong thet ciangin, ama nguak inndoi sungah hong tum a, patangno a lupna tungah a thisa in mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in kongkha khak in Topa tungah thu ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in patangno tungah boksuk a, a kam le a kam, a mit le a mit, a khut le a khut kisisak hi. Tuabangin patangno ii tungah kizanin a om ciang patangno ii ci lum tu in hong kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Elisha tho a, inndoi sung tengah vakin, tua zawkciang hong pai kik a, patangno ii tungah khatvei ma kizan kik hi. Patangno sia salivei hetchia lo a, tua sia zawkciang a mit hak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Elisha in Gehazi sam in, patangno ii nu sam a sawl hi. A nu hong sungtan ciang ama in, “Hi sungah, na tapa om hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama in Elisha peang ah boksuk a, a mai lei phasak hi; tua zawkciang a tapa la in paisan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Khatvei lai, ngam bup sungah kialpi khat a tun lai in Elisha sia Gilgal ah heak kik hi. Ama in kamsaangte honkhat a hil laitakin, a naseampa munah amate atu bealpui khat taw mei tungah sa tuihuan in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A naseamte khat lo sungah ngamh an pawlkhat la in pai hi. Ama in uum ngui khat mu a, uum nga a puak zawk za lo hi. Ama in tuate ciapui in bang ziam ci in he ngawl bul ma in, a sem zawkciang satui sungah tha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Pasalte neak tu in satui thuuk hi, ahihang amate in a tep po uh ciang, Elisha munah “Hisia ngu kisaw hi!” ci in a ne bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Elisha in, an tawm ngenin beal sungah tha hi, tuaciangin ama in, “Amate ii neak tu satui tawm thuuk thua lai vun,” ci hi. Tua zawkciang satui sia bangma siat huai nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hun dang khat ciang, Baal Shalishah panin pasal khat hong pai a, tua kum in a lak anpal mangtaang taw a vawt anluum luum kul le a balh tawm vaimim ngap pawlkhat hong paipui hi. Elisha in a naseampa munah tua kamsaangte, tuate taw vaakin sawl hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />ahihang naseampa in, “Mihing zakhat atu hi teng kikhom tu in um ni ziam?” ci in zo hi. Elisha in, “A neak tu in amate pia in, banghang ziam cile amate in ne tu a, a neak vaal zongh om tu hi, Topa in ci hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua ahikom a naseampa in an lui a, tuaciang Topa ii ci bangma in, amate theampo in ne a, pawlkhat vaal lai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Syria ngalkaphonpi ukpa Naaman sia Syria kumpipa in nasia takin zakta in upat vawt hi, banghang ziam cile Naaman tungtawnin Topa in Syria ngalkapte zawna pia hi. Ama sia ngalkap mang lian khat hi, ahihang ama in a kiitakhuai mama vun natna khat thuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate ii Israel a sim hunlai khat ah Syria te in Israel numeino khat ciapui in, tua nu sia Naaman zi ii naseamnu suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni khat ni in ama in a tonu tungah, “Samaria a teang kamsaangpa kungah ka topa pai thei le ka oai hi! Ama in a natna teng damsak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Naaman in hi thu a zaak ciang kumpipa kungah pai in, numeino ii pauna teng son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Israel kumpipa kungah va pai ta'n a, hi ka laithak sia na puak ta'n,” ci hi. Tua ahikom Naaman vai ding in, ngunntang 30,000, khamh tang 6,000, puan laih natu puan hoi sawm keng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama ii puak laithak sungah hi bang ki at hi: “Hi laithak in ka ngalkap bu Naaman kong heaksakna hi. A natna pan na damsak natu ka dei hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in tua laithak a sim ciangin, thinkiamna taw a puante eaukeak in, “Bangbangin Syria kumpipa in hisia pa damsak thei tu in kei hong um ziam? Nuntakna le thina tungah vaang a nei Pathian vei hong sa ziam? Ama kei taw kihau nuam in hanciam ahi hunlam kician hi!” ci in au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kamsaangpa Elisha in bang thu piang ci in a zaak ciangin ama in kumpipa tungah kam thaak hi: “Banghang tuaza in na thinngim ziam? Tua pa keima kungah hong puak ta'n, Israel ngam sungah kamsaang khat a om nginge hunlam lak tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom Naaman in a siphu te le a siphu ngalleang taw pai in Elisha ii kongbiang ah tawlnga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Elisha in a naseam khat paisak in, ama munah Jordan ngun sungah salivei kisil tahen, tua hile a natna pan dam thiang tu hi cisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang Naaman a thinso in tua mun nusia a, “Kei ngaisutna pan a nobel in ama kei kungah hong pusuak in, Topa a Pathian munah thu hong ngetsak tu a, ka natna mun santak teng tungah a khut hong vaan le, hong damsak tu in ka um hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua banah Damascus ah Abana ngun le Pharpar ngun te Israel ngam sungah ngun khat pawpo sangin phazaw hi ngawl ziam? Tuate sungah kibual in dam thei tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A naseamte ama kungah pai in, “Topa awng, kamsaangpa in a haksa vawt tu in hong sawl le zong vawt tu ni hi. Tu in ama ci bangin banghangin na dam natu in ngun sungah kibual paih lel ngawl tu ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jordan ngun ah Naaman paisuk in, Elisha ii ci bangin ngun tui sungah ama le ama salivei kipap a, tuaciang ama dam thiang sitset hi. Ama ii sa sia hong ciip in a ciidam a, nauno khat ii cii le sa bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in a mite theampo taw Elisha kungah hong heak kik a, “Tu in Israel ii Pathian ngawl pathian dang om ngawl hi ci in ka he hi; tua ahiciang topa awng, nong hesuakna in, kong piak letsong khat hong saang ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Elisha in, “A na ka sepsak a nungta Topa taw kiciam khi hi, letsong khat zongh saang ngawl tu khi hi,” ci in zo hi. Naaman in a saan natu in kunh top ahihang ama in saang nuam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom Naaman in, “Ka letsong hong saang ngawl tu na hile laa nii ii puakkhop leitang hong ciapuisak ta'n, banghang ziam cile tu pan kipan Topa tung simngawl pathian dang peuma tungah sangaw biakpiakna ahibuale meihal biakpiakna te pia nawn ngawl tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuabangin hi leng, Rimmon biakinn ah Syria pathian a biak tu in ka kumpipa ka zui ciang Topa in kei hong maisak tu in ka lamen hi. Topa in hong maisak tatak tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Elisha in, “Thinnuamin va pai ta'n,” ci hi. Tuaciang Naaman in paisan hi. Ama lam khuala a thet ma in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Elisha naseampa Gehazi in, ama le ama hi bangin, “Ka topa in Naaman sia bangma piasak ngawlin paithongsak hi. Tua Syria pa ii piak teng sia a saan tatak tu ahi hi. A nungta Topa min taw ama nung pan del in, na khat pawpo ama tung pan nga tong,” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in Naaman ii nung panin del hi. Naaman in ama nung pan mihing khat ii a del a mu ciangin a leang tung pan tuak a, ama taw kisi in, “A phamaw khat po om ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gehazi in “Om ngawl hi,” ci in zo hi. “Ahihang ka topa in nangma tungah sonin hong sawlna pan, tu ma hiat in Ephraim mualtung ngam panin kamsaangte pawl sung pan nii hong theng a, amate ngunntang tulthum le puan laih natu kop nii pia le hong oai hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Naaman in, “Nong hesuakna taw ngunntang tulluk la in,” ci in zo hi. Ama in lasak hamtang hi, ngunntangte ip nii sungah sawm in, puansilh laihna kop nii pia a, a naseamte nii aap in, Gehazi mai ah tua vanhte taw pai masa sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate sia Elisha teenna mualtung a thet ciang Gehazi in ipte nii saangin inn sungah sungtan pui hi. Tua zawkciang ama in Naaman ii naseamte ciasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama inn sungah tum kik a, tuaciang Elisha in ama munah, “Koisung pai ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Topa awng, koima pai bong,” ci in ama in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahihang Elisha in, “A mihingpa in nang taw kisi tu in leang tung pan hong tuak lai in, kei zongh ka thaa taw hong om ngawl ka na khi ziam? Hi bang sum ahizong, puan le olive huante ahizong, sapithuante ahizong, tuu le khuite ahizong, letsong saan tu hun hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tu in Naaman ii natna teng nang tungah hong theng tu a, nang le na suan na paal theampo in tua natna a tawntungin vei tu nu hi!” ci hi. Gehazi a pusua ciang ama in tua natna nga in — a vun sia vuuk bangin kaang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat ni in, Elisha ii uk kamsaang pawlkhat te in Elisha tungah amate lungkim ngawlna zasak uh hi, “Ka teenna mun uh no leih hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahikom, ka teen natu uh inn ka sak natu Jordan ngun ah pai a, thing pawlkhat hong phuksak thei ta'n,” ci uh hi. Elisha in, “Pha hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate sung pan khat in amate taw ton tu in Elisha paa a, ama lungkim in paikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jordan a thet uh ciangin amate sia naseam tu in hong kipan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate sung pan khat in thing khat a phu ciangin thakhat thu in a heitang zuukin tui sungah taak hi. Ama in Elisha munah, “Bang law tu khi ziam, Topa awng? Hei sia a kikawm hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Elisha in, “Koisung santak ah taak ziam?” ci in dongh hi. A taakna san a lak ciang Elisha in ciangkang khat saattan in, tui tungah a lot le a heitang tui tungah hong kilaamto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“La in,” ci in a sawl ciang tua pa kun sukin heitang tawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Syria kumpipa sia Israel taw kido hi. Ama in uliante taw kikum a, ngiaphual saat natu mun khat teal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang Elisha in Israel kumpipa tungah tua mun ii nai ah pai ngawlin a kidop natu kam thaak hi, banghang ziam cile Syria te in tua mun pan a suam tu in pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom Israel kumpipa in tua mun nai ah a om mihingte munah kidop natu thu puak hi, tuaciang amate sia ngal nang tu kithoai sa in om uh hi. Hi bangin tamvei ma hong piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Syria kumpipa sia hisia huvau in nasia takin a thin buai hi; ama in a uliante sam in, “No sung pan akua sia Israel kumpipa sangah pang nu ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khat in, “Kumpipa awng, kuama a pang om ngawl hi. Kamsaangpa Elisha in Israel kumpipa tungah na inndoi sungah thuku na son theampo zong son siat hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Ama koisungah om ziam? Zong vun! Ama man tu khi hi,” ci hi. Elisha sia Dathan ah om hi ci in a kison ciangin ama in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tua munah ngalkap le siphu ngalleang tam ma puak hi. Amate sia tua khua ah zan in theng a, uumci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A khuavak ni zing tuungin Elisha ii naseampa hong tho a, inn pua ah pusuakin khua a et ciang, khua kiimkot ah ngalkapte, siphu ngalleangte le siphute mu hi. Ama in inn sungah tum kikin, Elisha munah, “A lal hi zo hing, topa awng, bang ih law tu ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Elisha in, “Lau heak in, amate sangah a pangte sangin ei sangah hong pangte tamzaw hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama thungen a, “Oh, Topa , ama mittangte khua a mu thei natu honsak in,” ci hi. Topa in Elisha thungetna zo a, tuaciang Elisha ii naseampa in a et to le Elisha ii kiimkot mual pangh te sia siphu le meikuang siphu ngalleangte taw kidim in mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Syria te ii sim ciang Elisha in thungen a, “Oh Topa , hi mite a mit uh tawcipsak in!” ci hi. Topa in a thungetna zo a, a ngalte a mittaw cipsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaciang Elisha in amate kungah pai in, “No sia lam khial nu hi, khua na zon uh sia hi sung hi ngawl hi. Mihing na zon uh sia kungah keima hong paipui tu khi hi,” ci hi. Tuaciang ama in amate sia Samaria zotpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate khuapi sung a tum po ciang Elisha in thu ngen a, “A mittang uh honsak in, Topa awng, amate khuamusak thei in,” ci hi. Topa in a thungetna saang in, amate khuamusak kik a, tuaciang khua a et uh ciang amate sia Samaria sungsang ah om ahi hunlam kimu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in Syria te a mu ciang Elisha mun ah, “Ka thatlum tu ziam, topa ka thatlum tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Thatlum heak in, kidona phual ah na matsa ngalkapte zongh thisak ngawl tu ni hi. Amate neak tu dawn tu khat po pia in a, amate ii kumpipa kungah cia kiksak in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahikom Israel kumpipa in amate atu anneakpoai lian khat vawtsak a, amate ii a neak a dawn zawkciang Syria kumpipa kungah ciasak hi. Tua hun pan kipan Syria te in Israel ngam a sim tawntung teng kheal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawk tawm vei ciang Syria kumpipa Benhadad in ama ii ngalkaphonpi bup lampui in Samaria uumci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuabang a ki uumci hu in khuapi sungah anneak tu haksa mama a, laa khat ii lutang sia ngunntang 80 man a, inn vakhu eak gram 200 ciang ngunntang nga man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel kumpipa, khuapi luphungte tungah a vak laitak, numei khat au in, “Hong hu ta'n, Kumpipa awng!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in zo a, “ Topa in nang hong hu buale kei in nang bang hong pia zo tu khi ziam? Zungtaang ahibuale sapittui nei na khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na haksatna sia bang tatak ziam?” ci hi. Tua nu in, “Ning zeini in hi lai a numei sia in ngaisutna hong pia a, kei nauno sia tua ni in ne tu, a zing ciang ama ii nau sia ne tu ci in ka thukim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka nauno sia ka huan uh a ka ne uh hi. A khuavak ni ciang ama nau sia ne tu ka ci le ama in phual hi,’ ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kumpipa in hi thu a zaak ciang a khuangai in a puansilh lai eautham hi, tuaciang ama kung nai ah a pai mite in a puansilhte ii sungsang ah khau-ip puan a silh sia mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama au in, “Nitum ma in Elisha ii lu a kitan buale Pathian in hong vaat lum tahen!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in Elisha man tu in kamtai paisak hi. Tua laitakin Elisha sia a inn ah a haw upa pawlkhat taw om uh hi. Kumpipa ii kamtaite hong thet ma in, Elisha in upate munah, “Mithatpa in kei that tu in khat hong paisak hi! Tu in ama hi sung hong thet ciang kongkha khak vun a, tumsak heak vun. Kumpipa ama mama zongh a nung hiat pan hong pai tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hi teng a pau zongh man tak ngawl lai in kumpipa hong pai a, “Hi ngimna ei tungah hong puak sia Topa hi. Ama ii na khat pawpo a vawt tu ngakin banghangin om top tu khi ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elisha in, “ Topa pauna ngai in! Zing ciang tu hunin Samaria ngam sungah zungtaang phabel kilogramme thum ahibuale mangtaang kilogramme luk ciang ngunntang khat taw lei thei tu nu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa a cing tuam pa in Elisha mun ah, “Tuabang piang thei ngawl tu hi — Topa in thakhat thu in antang hong puak hial zong piang thei ngawl tu hi!” ci hi. Elisha in, “Tuabang a pian sia mu tu ni hi, ahihang nang in tua an peuma na ne ngei buatu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lauhuai vun natna a vei pasal li sia Samaria kongpi pua sangah om in, amate khat le khat a kipaupuina ah, “Banghangin hi sungah ih thi dong ngak tu hi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuapi sungah ih tum tu le lui thawthong hi, banghang ziam cile, tua munah ih pukthi tu hi; ahihang hi sungah om leang zong ih thi veve tu hi. Tua ahikom Syria te ii ngiaphual sungah tum ka tawng; a siabel amate ii hong vawt thei sia hong thatlum tu hi, ahizong ih nuntakna hong khoaikhe tha tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom khuazing tu a kithoai ciang, amate in Syria te ngiaphual ah pai uh hi, ahihang tua mun a thet uh ciangin, kuama a na om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in Syria te ii zaakna ah siphu te le siphu ngalleangte taw ngalkap honpui kuan in a nging bang khat zasak a, tuaciang Israel kumpipa in Hit le Egypt kumpite ngalcialin, amate simsak hi ci in Syria te in ngaisun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom tua nitakin Syria te in amate nuntakna kihuk natu in taikeak in, a puanbukte, siphute, laate le a ngiaphual uh sia a om babangin nusia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua pasal li teng in ngiaphual kiing a thet uh ciang, puanbuk khat sungah tum in, tua munah a mu po ne in dawn uh hi, ngunn, khamh le puansilh a mu po zongh zamh a, pusua pui in phual uh hi; tua zawkciang amate hong heak kik a, puanbuk dang khat ah tum in tuabang ma in ngamta uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang amate khat le khat ii tung ah, “Hi bangin ih ngamtat tu hi ngawl hi! Eima in thupha nga kasap, eima bek ii ih kep tu hi ngawl hi. Tua thu ih son natu in zingsang dong ih ngak le daan hong kipia nanak tu hi. Thakhatin pai in, kumpipa ii uliante munah ko tawng!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate sia Syria te ngiaphual nusia in Samaria ah heak kik a, kongpi cingte oksan in, “Ko teng Syria te ngiaphual ah ka pai uh le kuama mu ngawlin, a pau a haam zongh za ngawl khu hi; a siphute le a laate zongh a khau uh kisuut ngawl hi; tuaciang puanbukte zongh Syria te ii nusiat bang linlian in om hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kongpi cingte in tua thu taangko in, kumpi inn sungah tua thu hong kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zan lai ma hi napi kumpipa hong tho a, a uliante munah, “Syria te ii ngealna teng hong son tu khi hi! Amate in hi sungah kialpi a tun sia he hi, tua ahikom amate in ngiaphual nusia a, ngam sungah a bu tu in pai hi. Amate in ei sia an zong a khuapi nusia tu in hong um hi, tuaciang amate in ei hong hing mat tu a, khuapi hong suan tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama uliante khat in, “Hilai khuapi sung a mite sia bangbang po ahizong a thisate taw kibangin a lal hi zo hi hing. Tua ahikom thupiang teng ih mu thei natu in, a thi mong siphu nga teng taw pasal pawlkhat paisak tawng,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in pasal pawlkhat teal in, kumpipa in siphu ngalleang nii taw paisak a, Syria ngalkaphonpi bang tat ziam ci in dawpsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pasalte Jordan ngun dong pai in, lamdung ah Syria ngalkapte ii a tai kawmin a nusiat puan le vanh te mu uh hi. Tua zawkciang amate hong heak kik in, kumpipa tungah thu ko uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Samaria mite manlang tak hong pusuak in Syria te ngiaphual phuul uh hi. Tuaciangin Topa ii ci sa bangma in a zungtaang phabel kilogramme 3 ahibuale mangtaang kilogramme 6 ciangin ngunntang khat taw kizuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel kumpipa in ama a cing tuam ulian pa sia khuapi kongpi uk tu in na koi luilam hi. Tua ulian pa sia tualai ah mipite in siiklum hi, kumpipa in ama taw kimu tu in a pai laitak Elisha ii sonkhol bangin thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Elisha in kumpipa munah a zing ciang tua hunin zungtaang a phabel kilogramme 3 ahibuale mangtaang kilogramme 6 ciang ngunntang khat taw kizuak tu hi a ci lai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tua ulian pa in, “Tuabang piang thei ngawl tu hi — Topa mama in thakhat thu in antang hong puak hial zong piang thei ngawl tu hi!” ci in zo hi. Tuaciang Elisha in, “Tuasia a pian mu tu ni hi, ahihang nang in na ne ngei buatu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuasia bang tatakin ama ii tungah piang a, ama thi hi — khuapi kongpi ah mite in ama tuanhlum hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu in Elisha in Shunem ah a teang, a tapa a nuntak kiksak nupinu munah, Topa in kum sali sung a ngei tu kialpi khat a ngam sungah a tunsak natu le ama sia leidang khat ah a innkuanpuite taw pai in a teen tu a kulna thu son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in a sawlna mangin a innkuanpuite taw Philistia ah kum sali sung teang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum sali bo zawkciang ama Israel ngam ah hong heak kik a, kumpipa ii munah a inn le a leitangte ama tungah a kipiak kik natu ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in kumpipa sia Elisha ii naseampa Gehazi taw kipaupui in om mu hi; kumpipa in Elisha ii a lamdang nasepte he nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gehazi in Elisha ii a thisa mi khat a thawsak kikna thu kumpipa tungah a sawson laitakin tua nu in kumpipa tungah thuumna nei hi. Gehazi in, “Kumpipa awng, tua nupi sia le Elisha ii a nuntak kiksak a tapa sia hi sungah om hi,” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa ii dokna te a zona in Gehazi ii son teng sia maan hi ci in nupi nu in son hi, tuasia ciang kumpipa in a uliante khat samin, ama ii neisa teng theampo a piak kik natu le kum sali a om ngawl sung theampo a, a lo sung pan a piang ante theampo ii man taw ama ii a neisa teng theampo a piak kik tu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Syria te ii Kumpipa Benhadad ii ciinat hun khat laitakin Elisha sia Damascus khua ah pai hi. Elisha tua munah om ci in kumpipa tungah a kison ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ama in a uliante khat ahi Hazael munah, “Kamsaangpa letsong khat na puak ta'n a, kei ka ciidam tu ziam, dam ngawl tu khi ziam Topa hong doksak tahen,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom Hazael in Damascus pan a piang vanh phabel teng kalaoh 40 tungah suanhin Elisha kungah pai hi. Hazael in ama taw a kimu ciang ama in, “Na naseampa Kumpipa Benhadad in nang kungah pai in ama ii natna sia dam tu ziam dam nawn ngawl tu ziam ci sia nang kungah pai in dongh tu in hong sawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Elisha in zo a, “ Topa in ama thi tu hi ci in hong lak hi; ahihang ama ii kungah va pai ta'n a, ama dam kik tu hi na ci ta'n,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuasia zawkciang Elisha in a lauhuai mama mai puak taw Hazael ii om nuam ngawl a sak dong a maitang salh hi. Thakhat thu in Elisha a thitui luang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hazael in, “Banghangin kap ni ziam, topa awng,” ci in dongh hi. “Israel mite tungah a lipkhaphuai mama na ngamtat tu teng ka heak hu hi,” ci in zo kik hi. Nangma in a kulhpite na haltum tu a, a khangmoi tangval a phabel teng na thatlum tu a, patangnote na vaatlum tu hi, naungil omte ii ngil na khuakeak tu hi,” Elisha in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Banghangin tua zata in vaanglian thei tu khi ziam kei sia bangma ka hi bua hi,” Hazael in ci hi. “ Topa in hong son zo hi, nang sia Syria te ii kumpipa na suak tu hi,” ci in Elisha in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hazael sia Benhadad kungah heak kikin, ama in, “Elisha in bang hong ci ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Ama in nang sia dam kik tatak tu hi, hong ci hi,” Hazael in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang a khuavak ni ciang Hazael in puanvan khat tui sungah pap a, tuasia taw kumpipa ii nuntakna sumit hi. Tuaciang Hazael in Syria Kumpipa Benhadad ii za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel te Kumpipa Ahab ii tapa Joram ii maan zawk a kum ngana ciang Judah te Kumpipa Jehoshaphat ii tapa Jehoram sia kumpipa suak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ama ii kum, kum 32 pha a, tuaciang ama in Jerusalem panin kum liat sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A zi sia Ahab ii tanu hi a, tuaciang Ahab ii innkuante bangma in ama in Israel kumpipa ii ngamtat siat teng ma zui hi. Ama in Topa tungah maw hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ahihang Topa in Judah sia a susia nuam bua hi, banghang ziam cile ama in a naseampa David munah, a suan a paalte in a kizom suakin uk tu hi ci in kamciam pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jehoram ii maan sungin Edom te in Judah te langpanin leedo uh a, amate le amate a ki uk kumpi ngam hong suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jehoram in ama ii siphu ngalleang theampo taw Zair ah kuan a, tua munah Edom ngalkap honte in amate uumci uh hi. Zan lai in ama le a siphu ngalleang ukte in a kikiim uumna phultham thei in, suakta uh a, a ngalkapte sia amate inn tek ah kithethaang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Edom sia tua hun pan kipan Judah te khutnuai pan amate le amate a ki uk suak hi. Hi hun sung ma in Libnah khuapi zongh in leedo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jehoram ii a sep a vawt dangte theampo Judah Kumpite ii Taanghthu sungah kiciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jehoram thi a, David khuapi sung kumpite thaan ah kiphumin, a tapa Ahaziah in a kumpi za lua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel te ii kumpipa Ahab ii tapa Joram a maan zawk kum sawm le kum nii na ciang Jehoram ii tapa Ahaziah sia Judah te ii kumpipa suak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />ama kum 22 pha a, ama in Jerusalem panin kum khat sung uk hi. A nu sia Athalia hi a, kumpipa Ahab ii tanu, Israel kumpipa Omri ii tunu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahaziah sia a zi hangin Ahab ii mealheak khat a sua bangin, Ahab ii innkuanpuite bangma in ama in Topa tungah maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahaziah in Israel te kumpipa Joram taw kipawl khawm in Syria te ii kumpipa Hazael do uh hi. Ngalkap honte sia Gilead ngam Ramoth ah hong kisii uh a, Joram sia ngal kisimna sungah liam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in Jezreel khuapi ah heak kikin, a liamna pan a dam kik tu ngak hi, tuaciang Ahaziah in tua munah pai in ve hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hun sungin kamsaangpa Elisha in kamsaang khangmoi khat munah, “Kithoai in a, Gilead ah a om Ramoth ah va pai ta'n. Hi olive thau thawl sia keng ta'n a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuaciang tua mun na thet ciang Jehoshaphat ii tapa, Namshi ii tupa Jehu na zong ta'n. A lawmte kung pan samkhia in inndoi tuam khat sungah paipui in a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />hi olive thau sia a lu tungah buakin, ‘ Topa in nang sia Israel te ii kumpipa tu in taangko hi,’ ci ta'n. Tua zawkciang tua mun sia a manlang thei zaza in nusia in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom kamsaang khangmoi pa Ramoth ah pai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tua munah ngalkap maangte thu kikum mu hi. Ama in, “Topa awng, nang atu kamthaak khat hong keng khi hi,” ci hi. Jehu in, “Ko teng sungah akua hong paupui ni ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Topa awng, nangma ni hi,” ci in ama in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate nii sia inn doituam sungah tum a, tuaciang kamsaang khangmoipa in Jehu ii lu tungah olive thau buakin ama munah, “ Topa Israel te ii Pathian in taangko hi: ‘Keima in nang sia Israel te ii kumpipa tu in sathau hong noai khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jezebel ii ka kamsaangte le a dang ka naseamte a thalup hu in daan ka piak natu in, nangma in na topa, kumpipa Ahab ii tapa sia thatlum tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahab ii innkuanpuite le a suan a paalte a thi siat kul tu hi; a moi a haam a kibangin a bangkua sungah pa a minpiang heamkhia tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama ii bangkua tungah Israel te ii Kumpipa Jeroboam tung ahizong, Israel te kumpipa Baasha ii tungah ahizong, ka vawt bangin vawt tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jezebel sia kiphum ngawl tu hi; a luang sia Jezreel ngamkhen sungah ui in ne tu hi,’ ” ci hi. Hi teng a ci zawkciang kamsaang moi pa pusuakin tai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jehu sia a ngalkap maang puite kungah pai kik a, amate in, “Na theampo a pha na'am? Tua a mawmawt tuak pa sia in nang tung pan bang dei ziam?” ci uh hi. Jehu in, “Ama ii dei sia he nu hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in, “Ko he ngawl khu hi, hong son ta'n,” ci in zo uh hi. Ama in keima munah, Topa in hi bangin taangko hi: “Nangma sia Israel te ii kumpipa tu in sathau hong noai khi hi,” ci in hong son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thakhat thu in Jehu ii ngalkap maang puite in a puantual uh keallei tungah Jehu ii dinpha tu in pha uh a, lemle tumin, “Jehu sia Kumpipa hi!” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jehu in Kumpipa Joram suamlup tu sawm hi, ama sia Syria Kumpipa Hazael taw Ramoth ah a kidona a liamna pan a dam kik natu in Jezreel ah om hi. Tua ahikom Jehu in ama ii ngalkap maang puite munah kei sangah nong pang uh ahile Jezreel ah mipite kidop natu son tu in Ramoth pan kuama pai ku heak vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama a siphu ngalleang tungah hong kaa in Jezreel zuan tu in vaiding hi. Joram sia dam kik ngawl lai hi, Judah te kumpipa Ahaziah zongh ama ve in om lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jezreel tausaang tung pan ngalvil vaipuak a nei sia in, Jehu le a mite hong neak sia mu hi. “Mihing pawlkhat siphu tung to in hong pai ka mu hi,” ci in au hi. Joram in, “Tual ziam maw ngal ziam siphu ngalkap khat pai in kansak vun,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kamtai pa Jehu kungah pai in, ama munah, “Kumpipa in nang sia lawm khat bangin nong pai ziam ci in he nuam hi,” ci hi. Jehu in, “Tuasia nang taw bangma kisai bo, ka nung panin hong zui ta'n,” ci in zo hi. Tausaang tung a ngalvil pa in, kamtai pa sia hong paite taw kisii napi hong heak kik ngawl hi ci in thu ko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kamtai dang khat ma paisak uh a, ama in Jehu sia a mai a pa ii dok teng ma dongh hi. Tuaciang Jehu in “Tuasia nang taw bangma kisai bo, ka nung uh pan hong zui ta'n,” ci in zo leleau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khatvei ma khuapi cing pa in, kamtaipa le hong papai pawlte kimu napi ama hong heak kik nawn ngawl hi, ci hi. Ama ii belapna ah, “Hong pai pawlte ii lampui pa in a siphu ngalleang sia mihing thin amh bang phet in nasia takin hawl hi, Jehu taw kibang hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ka siphu ngalleang a pai tu kithoaisak vun,” ci in kumpipa Joram in thupia hi. Tuabang ma in, ama le kumpipa Ahaziah sia amate siphu ngalleang tek tung to in Jehu taw kisi tu in hong pai uh hi. Amate in Naboth ii lo sungah ama taw kisi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Lem thu taw hong pai nu ziam?” ci in Joram in dongh hi. Jehu in, “Bangbangin lem thu om thei tu ziam, Na nu Jezebel ii patsa bum le ai toaite ahizong, milim biakna ahizong, ih nei lai teng lem thu om thei ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Ahaziah awng, hisia kilee heakna hi,” ci in Joram au a, a siphu ngalleang heak in, tai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jehu in a thal eal in a tha nei za taw a kap le Joram ii cingzaang pan kha in a lungtang sunlet a, Joram sia ama siphu ngalleang sungah pukin thi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tuaciang, Jehu in ama a hu pa Bidkar munah, “A luang la in a, Naboth ii lo sungah vawk in. Nang le kei kumpipa Ahab ii nung pan siphu tung to in ih pai lai in, Topa in Ahab huvau,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘Zeini in Naboth le a tate a kisuamlupna ka mu hi. Tuaciang kamciam kong piakna pan, lo hisia sung mama ah nang daan hong pia tu khi hi’ ci in a pau sia na ciamtee lai ziam? Tua ahikom Joram ii luang la in, Topa ii kamciam sia a taangtun natu in, Naboth ii lo sungah vawk in,” Jehu in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahaziah in bang teng piang ci in mu a, a siphu ngalleang taw Beth Haggan khua sangah tai a, Jehu in del hi. “Ama zongh that vun,” ci in Jehu in a mite sawl hi, tuaciangin ama a siphu ngalleang Ibleam khua hui Gur sang lam tungah hawlto a, amate in liamsua hi. Ahihang Megiddo khuapi a thet dong a leang hawl thei a, tua mun a thet ciang thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama ii uliante in a luang siphu ngalleang khat taw pua in, David Khuapi sung kumpi thaan ah phum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel te Kumpipa Ahab ii tapa Joram a maan zawk a kum sawm le khat kum in Ahaziah sia Judah te kumpipa suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jehu sia Jezreel khua ah theng hi. Jezebel in bang thu teng piang ci in za zo a, a ma in mitkhu vom za kinoai in, a sam pot in, kumpi inn tung khelki panin lampi ensuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jehu sia khuapi kongpi sungah a tum ciangin ama in oksan a, “Nang Zimri! Nang tual that pa! Hi sungah bang hi ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jehu in ento a, “Akua teng kei sangah hong pang nu ziam?” ci hi. Kumpi inn sung uliante nii khawng thum khawng in khelki pan en suk hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />tuaciang Jehu in, “Ama hong vawk suk tavun,” ci hi. Amate in a vawksuk uh le pangte tungah a chi kithe a, siphute tung zongh ah kithe hi. Jehu in a siphu le a leang ama ii luang tungah hawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />kumpi inn sungah tum hi, tuaciangin an ne hi. Tua zawkciang bekma in hi bang ci hi. “Tua a kitomlaw sa numei sia la vun a phum vun; a tatakin ci leang ama zongh kumpipa tanu khat hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahihang ama phum tu a pai te in a lungu le a khut ngu, a peang ngu simngawl bangma mu nawn ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hi thu amate in Jehu munah a ko uh ciangin Jehu in, “Hi sia Topa ii naseampa Elijah tungah a sonsa bangin a piang hi: ‘Jezreel ii ngamkhen sungah uite in Jezebel luang ne tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama ii pumpi sia eak bangin kithethaang tu hi, tuasia ciang kuama in ama pumpi ahi hunlam son thei ngawl tu hi,’ ci hi,” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samaria khuapi ah Ahab ii suan le paalte mihing 70 om uh hi. Jehu in khuapi ukte, khuapi sungah lampuite le Ahab ii suan le paalte a keamte munah lai at a thaak hi. A laithak sungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“No sia kumpipa ii suan le paalte a keam te nu hi, tuaciang na uuk po na zak tu uh siphu ngalleang te, siphute, ngalhiamte le kulh taw a ki uum khuapite nei nu hi. Tua ahikom hi laithak na nga uh po ciang
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kumpipa ii suan le paal sung pan a kilawmbel khat teal in, kumpipa suaksak vun a, tuaciang ama hung tu in ngal do vun,” ci in at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Samaria ukpite sia lau mama uh hi. “Kumpipa Joram le kumpipa Ahaziah ii zaw ngawl Jehu sia ei in bangbangin nalh zo tu hi ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom kumpi inn ah vaipuak neite, khuapi tungah vaipuak neite kikopin, ngammite lampuite le kumpipa bangkua a keamte in hi kamthaak sia Jehu tungah puak uh hi; “Ko sia na naseamte khu hi, nangma ii ci po a seam tu in kinging khu hi. Ahihang kuama kumpipa in koi ngawl tu khu hi; phabel na sak bangin hong seam ta'n,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jehu in laithak dang khat puak hi: “Kei sangah nong pang uh a, tuaciang ka thupiak babang zui tu na hi uh le, zing ciang tu hunin Kumpipa Ahab ii suan le paal teng ii lutang hong puak tavun,” ci hi. Kumpipa Ahab ii suan le paal 70 teng sia Samaria ngammi lampuite ii kep le ou ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jehu laithak a kinga ciangin, Samaria lampuite in Ahab ii suan le paal 70 teng thatlum in a lutang uh bawm sungah heangin Jehu omna Jezreel ah puak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahab ii suan le paalte ii lutang teng hong kipaipui zo hi ci in Jehu tungah a kison ciang ama in tua lutangte khuapi kongpi hui ah kholh nii in sengin a zingsang kik dong tua munah a kinusiat tu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A zingsang ciangin ama khuapi kongpi ah pai in, tua munah a om mite munah, “Kumpipa Joram suam tu a sawm sia keima khi hi; no sia tua tungtaang ah bangma vaipuak nei ngawl nu hi. Ahihang hite sia akua in thatlum ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi sia in Ahab ii suan le paalte huvau Topa ii kamsaang Elijah ii tungtawnin a pau teng taangtung hi,” ci in lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jehu in Ahab ii bee le phung dangte, Jezreel a om theampo le a uliante, a ngualtamhte, a thiampite, khat zongh a nungta in kikhoaikhe ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jehu in Samaria khua ah pai tu in Jezreel khua nusia hi. Lampi tung mun khat, “Tuucingte Ngiaphual” a kicina munah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thisa Judah kumpipa Ahaziah ii mealheakte pawlkhat taw kisi in amate tungah, “A kuate nu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Amate in, “Ahaziah ii mealheakte khu hi! Kumpinu Jezebel tate le kumpi innkuanpui a taanglaite zatakna pia tu in Jezreel ah pai tu khu hi,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jehu in, “Hing mat siat vun!” ci in a ngalkapte thupia hi. A ngalkapte in amate manin Jehu in dum khat ii hui ah that siat hi. A vekpi in mihing 42 pha a, khat zongh khoaikhe ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jehu vaiding kik a, lampi ah Rechab ii tapa Jonadab taw kisi uh hi. Jehu in paupui a, “Nang le kei ih khua ngaisutna kibang hi, Kei nong panpui tu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Jonadab in, “Hong panpui tu khi hi,” ci in zo hi. “Na khut hong thaak ta'n,” Jehu in ci hi. Amate kilen uh hi, tuaciang Jehu in ama sia siphu ngalleang tungah a kaato zawk natu kaito in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Keima taw paikhawm tawng, Topa tungah bangza in kipia khi ziam nangma ma in hong mu ta'n,” ci in son kawm hi. Tuaciang amate Samaria ah leang taw paikhawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua mun a thet ciang Jehu in Ahab ii mealheak theampo khat zongh khoaikhe ngawlin thatlum siat hi. Hi sia in Topa ii Elijah munah piang tu hi ci in a sonsa teng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jehu in Samaria ngammite kaikhawm in hi bang ci hi, “Kumpipa Ahab in Baal pathian sia tawmno bia hi, ahihang keima in tua sangin a nasia zaw in ka bia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Baal ii kamsaangte theampo le ama a biate theampo, ama thiampite theampo a vekpi hong sam siat tavun. Kuama kamzong thei ngawl tu hi; Baal tungah sangaw biakpiakna nasia takin vawt tu khi hi, tuaciang hi sungah hong kihel ngawl peuma kithisak tu hi,” ci hi. (Hi sia in Jehu ii a theamna hi a, Baal a biate theampo a thalup nopna hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jehu in thupia a, “Baal zatak piak natu biakna ni khat thangsak vun,” ci hi. Thu thansakna kivawt a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuaciang Jehu in Israel ngam bup ah kam zasak hi. Baal a bia theampo hong pai uh hi, hong pai ngawl khat zongh om ngawl hi. Amate theampo Baal biakinn sungah tum uh a, biakinn monglang pan monglang dong dim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaciang Jehu in puantual thiangtho a keam thiampipa munah puantualte pusua in biakpiakna a vawtte pia in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jehu ama mama zongh biakinn sungah, Rechab ii tapa Jonadab taw tum a, tuaciang tuasung ah om mihingte munah, “Baal biate bek a sungah om tu a, tuaciang Topa a biate kuama a kihel ngawl natu in a pha takin en vun,” ci in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama le Jonadab in pai in sangaw biakpiakna, meihal biakpiakna Baal tungah pia hi. Ama in pasal 80 biakinn pua sangah koi a, hi bangin thupia hi. “Hi mihingte a vekpi in thatlum siat tu nu hi, khat po in amate a suaktasak a om le ama ii nuntakna taw lul tu hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jehu in biakpiakna a vawt zawkciang a cingte munah, “Tum vun a, a vekpi in thatlum siat vun; khat zongh suaktasak heak vun,” ci hi. Amate namsau daw sa in tum a, a vekpi in thatlum siat in, amate luang sia doipua ah kaikeak uh hi. Tua zawkciang amate a sungnung biakna munah tumin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />a thiangtho khuam sia pusua uh a, haltum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuabangin amate in a thiangtho khuam sia susia in biakinn zongh susia uh a, a biakinn sia eakbuk suaksak uh hi, tu ni dong ma in tuabangin om lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuabangin Jehu in Israel ngam ah Baal biakna phiat siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahihang khamh khuital limte Bethel le Dan ah koi in Israel te in biasak a, mawna sungah a lampui kumpipa Jeroboam ii ngamtatna teng ama in zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa in Jehu tungah, “Ahab le a suan a paalte tungah vawt a kong oai theampo vawt zo ni hi. Tua ahikom na suante khang li dong Israel te kumpipa in koi tu khi hi ci in kamciam hong pia khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahihang Jehu in a thin theampo taw Topa Israel te ii Pathian thukhamte ni ngawl a, ama in Israel te mawna sungah a then Jeroboam ngamtatna zuizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua hun laitakin Topa in Israel ngam ii a zaina khiam tu in hong kipan hi. Syria Kumpipa Hazael in Israel te ii ngam theampo zo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jordan ii nisuana Aroer khuapi thangsang Arnon Ngun hui dong zo hi — tuasung ah Gilead le Bashan ngamkhen te, Gad, Reuben le Nisuana Manasseh te ii teenna teng kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jehu ii a sep a vawt dangte theampo ama ii hanna nasepte dong Israel Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama thi a Samaria ah kiphum hi, tuaciang ama ii tapa Jehoahaz in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jehu in Israel kumpipa khat a hina taw Samaria panin kum 28 sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahaziah ii nu Athaliah in a tapa ii kisuamlupna a zaak po ciang kumpipa innkuan pui theampo thalup natu thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahaziah ii tapa Joash bekma suakta hi. Ama sia a dangte taw kithatlum dektak a, ahihang a ni Jehosheba in suatak hi, tua nu sia Kumpi Jehoram ii tanu hi a, Ahaziah ii suapui sealh ahi hi. Ama in Joash sia a keam nu taw la in Biakinnpi sung lupna inndoi khat sungah koi a, kithalup ngawl natu in Athaliah ii mu natu pan seal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum luk sung Jehosheba in patangno sia biakinn sungah Athaliah ii Kumpinu a sep sung theampo phual hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang a kum sali na ciangin thiampi Jehoiada in kumpipa a cingte le kumpi inn a cingte a uk uliante Biakinn ah samin, ama ii ngealna bang a ngamtat nop natu kiciamna taw thukimna vawtsak hi. Ama in Kumpipa Ahaziah ii tapa Joash amate lak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuaciang hi thupiakna teng pia hi: “Sabbath ni in vaipuak la tu in nong pai uh ciang, no sung pan see thum sua see khat in kumpi inn cing tu nu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a dang see thum sua see khat sia Sur Kongpi cingin om tu nu hi, tuaciang a om lai see thum sua see khat te inn kongpi ah kong cingte nung pan cing sawn tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sabbath ni a vaipuak nei ngawl a om pawl nii te sia kumpipa hung tu in Biakinnpi ah a cingin om tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa Joash sia noma in namsau daw sa in cing tu a, ama ii paina theampo ah ama ompui tu nu hi. No ii nai ah hong pai khat po a om le thatlum tu nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Uliante in Jehoiada ii hil bangin ni a, a mite ama kungah paipui hi — Sabbath ni a vaipuak nei ngawlte le vaipuak neite paipui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in uliante sia David ii neisa, Biakinnpi sungah a kikeam tei le lum te pia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuaciang ama in kumpipa cing tu in ngalkapte sia a namsau daw sa in Biakinn mai kiimkot ah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jehoiada in Joash pusua pui in, kumpilukhu a lu tungah koi a, kumpite ii zak tu thukham laibu bu khat Joash pia hi. Tua zawkciang Joash sia sathau noai in kumpipa hi ci in taangko uh hi. Mipite in a khut uh beang uh a, “Kumpipa a khansau tahen!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpinu Athaliah in a cing ngalkapte le mipite ii awsa za ahikom, mihonpi kikhawm in a omna Biakinnpi ah manlang in pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngeina om bangin kumpipa thak sia Biakinnpi tumna khuampi kungah dingin a om sia kumpinu in mu hi. Ama sia uliante le lemle tumte in kiim uum uh a, mipite a vekpi in lungnuam takin au in, lemle tum uh hi. Athaliah in a puansilh baltham in, “Hong leeheak hi! Hong leeheak hi!” ci in au hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jehoiada in Athaliah sia biakinnpi huang sungah a kithalup tu oai ngawl ahikom ama in ngalkap uliante munah: “A ngual a ngualin a cingte kilaklaw panin ama la in paipui vun, ama suatak a sawm pawpo that vun,” ci in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in Athaliah manin, kumpi inn ah paipui uh a, tua mun Siphu Kongpi ah ama thatlum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thiampi Jehoiada in Kumpipa Joash le mipite, Topa ii mite a sua natu in Topa taw thuciamna vawtsak hi; ama in kumpipa le mipite kilaklaw ah zongh thuciamna vawtsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zawkciang mipite in Baal ii biakinn ah pai uh a, biakinn baltham uh hi; amate in biaknataute le milimte saat tham uh a, tuaciang Baal ii thiampi Mattan sia biaknatau ii mai ah thatlum hi. Jehoiada in Biakinn ah a cingte koi in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tua zawkciang ama sia ngalkap uliante, kumpipa a cing ngalkapte, le kumpi inn a cingte in kumpipa sia Biakinnpi pan kumpi inn ah paipui uh a, mihonpite in zui uh hi. Joash in Cinna Kongpi panin tumin, kumpi tokhum tungah ama ii mun hong la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mipi theampo sia lungdam uh a, kumpi inn sungah Athaliah zongh kithat zo ahikom khuapi sung sia ngamdai in om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joash sia kum sali a phak laitakin Judah te kumpipa suak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel ah Jehu Kumpipa a maan zawk a kum salina ciang Joash sia Judah te ii kumpipa suakin, ama in Jerusalem panin kum sawmli sung uk hi. A nu sia Beersheba khua panin Zibiah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A khan tawntung ama in Topa ii diksak tu bebekin ngamta hi, banghang ziam cile Jehoiada thiampipa in ama hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahitazong doai biakna munte kisusia ngawl a, tuaciang mihingte in sangaw biakpiakna le ngimnamtui halna te tua munah vawt tan lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Joash in thiampite sam a, Biakinnpi sungah sangaw biakpiakna tungtaang sum a kipiate, hun maan a sangaw biakpiakna tung pan sumte ahizong amate tungah a thin zawna taw piakte ahizong, tua sumte a top natu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thiampi sim in ama ii sepsak mite tung pan a nga uh sumte vaipuak in a laak natu le a kisamh bangin Biakinnpi puua natu a kizak natu in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang Joash ii maan zawk a kum 23 dong sia thiampite in Biakinnpi puuana khat zongh nei ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in Jehoiada le a dang thiampite samin, “Banghangin Biakinnpi puua ngawl nu ziam? Tu pan kipan sum na saan uhte noma keam nawn ngawl tu nu hi; Biakinnpi puua natu in aap tu nu hi,” ci in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thiampite lungkim uh a, Biakinnpi amate ii puua kul ngawl tu sia zongh thukim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jehoiada in thingkuang khat la in, a sitna tungah a hawng khat vut hi, tuaciang a thingkuang sia biaknatau ii kung, Biakinnpi sung tumna ii ziatsang ah koi hi. Tumna munah vaipuak a nei thiampi sia in biakpiakna a piate ii sum theampo thingkuang sungah khia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thingkuang sungah sum tam a om simin kumpipa ii thuzeakpa le Thiampi Lianbelpa hong pai in, ngunn teng a tui thapsak zawkciang khai tee uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pha za tatak a kiteptee zawkciang Biakinnpi sung nasepte a ukpa tungah a ngunnte aap in, tua pa in lettamate, inn sate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />uksuang ciangte, suang at te pia in, inn puua natu in a kisamh thing le suangte theampo lei a, a dang zak tu a kisam theampo pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahizong a sumte sung panin ngunn haite, kuangte, lemle te, meiinn taw kisai vanhzakte, ngunn le khamh taw a kivawt vanh te ii manh tu in kizangh ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua sumte sia naseamte thaman le biakinn puuana sung a kizangh vanhte leina bekin kizangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua nasep taw kisai in a ukte sia thumaan takpi ahikom tua sumte tungtaang ah sazian koi kul ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khialphel biakpiakna le mawphel biakpiakna atu a kipia sumte sia thingkuang sungah kikoi ngawl hi; tuate sia thiampite neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua hunin, Syria te ii Kumpipa Hazael in Gath khuapi simin zo hi; tua zawkciang ama in Jerusalem sim tu sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah te Kumpipa Joash in ama ii mai ah a maang Jehoshaphat, Jehoram, le Ahaziah te ii Topa tungah a aapsa uh piakkhiatnate la in ama ii piakkhiatna taw ngawm a, Biakinnpi sung le kumpi inn sungah khamh theampo taw kop in Kumpipa Hazael letsongin a piak ciang, tua kumpipa in a ngalkapte Jerusalem panin leidang zot pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa Joash ii a sep a vawt a dang theampo sia Judah Kumpite Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kumpipa Joash ii uliante in ama thalup sawm uh a, tuate sung pan nii, Shimeath ii tapa Jozacar le Shomer ii tapa Jehozabad in Jerusalem nisuana sangah lei kihukna mun Silla paisukna lampi tungah a kisa inn sia sungah thatlum uh hi. Joash sia David ii Khuapi sung kumpi thaan ah kiphum a, a tapa Amaziah in a kumpipa za laih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah te Kumpipa Ahaziah ii tapa Joash maan zawk a kum 23 kumin, Jehu ii tapa Jehoahaz sia Israel te ii kumpipa suak a, ama in Samaria panin kum sawm le kum sali uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama mai ah kumpipa Jeroboam bangma in ama in Topa tungah maw a, Israel mite mawna sungah thetpui hi; ama in a ngilo ngamtatnate kheal ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa sia Israel tungah thin uuk hi, tuaciang ama in Syria te kumpipa Hazael le a tapa Benhadad in Israel sia hun khat zawk hun khat zosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jehoahaz in Topa tungah thungen a, tuaciang Topa in Syria te ii kumpipa in Israel mite nasia takin a kinengcip a mu ciang a thungetna zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Israel te lampui khat puak a, Syria te khut sung pan ama in suatak hi, tuaciang nidang bangma in, Israel sia ngammuangin om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang amate in Kumpipa Jeroboam ii Israel mite mawna sungah a lampuina te nusia ngawl uh a, tua mawnate ma vawt suak lai uh hi, tuaciang numeipathian Asherah ii lim sia Samaria ah taanglai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jehoahaz in siphu ngalkap 50, siphu ngalleang sawm le ngalkap 10000 simngawl ngalkap nei ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile Syria kumpipa in a dang teng susia in leivui bangin amate tuanhcil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoahaz ii a sep a vawt le a hanna dang teng sia Israel Kumpite Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama thi a, Samaria ah kiphum hi, tuaciang a tapa Jehoash in a kumpi za lua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah te Kumpipa Joash ii maan zawk a kum 37 kumin Jehoahaz ii tapa Jehoash sia Israel te ii kumpipa suak hi, tuaciang ama in Samaria pan kum sawm le kum luk sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in zongh Israel te mawna sungah a lampui, Kumpipa Jeroboam ii siatna teng zui in Topa tungah maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama ii sep le vawt dangte, Judah te kumpipa Amaziah taw a kidona sungah a hanna theampo a kihel in Israel Kumpipate ii Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jehoash thi a Samaria khua kumpi thaan ah kiphum a, a tapa Jeroboam II in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kamsaangpa Elisha sia thithei natna taw na a, ama thi tu in a lupna ah Israel te Kumpipa Jehoash in ve hi. “Ka pa awng, ka pa awng!” ci in au in kap hi. “Nang sia Israel a hung a thahat pa ni hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Elisha in, Jehoash tungah, “Thal khat le thaltang pawlkhat hong la ta'n,” ci in thupia hi. Jehoash in tuate la a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Elisha in tua thal kaap tu in kinging in sawl hi. Kumpipa in a sawl bangin mang a, tuaciang Elisha in a khut sia kumpipa khut tungah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kamsaangpa ii sawl bangin Syria ngam sang a nga khelki sia kumpipa in hong hi. “Thaltang kap in!” ci in Elisha in thupia hi. Kumpipa ii thaltang a kaa zawk po ciang kamsaangpa pau a, “Nang sia Topa ii thaltang ni hi, tua taw Topa in Syria te zo tu hi. Nangma in Aphek ah Syria te na zaw dong na do tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Elisha in kumpipa munah thaltang dang teng zongh la in lei saatna nei in ci in sawl hi. Kumpipa in lei thumvei saat a, tua zawkciang tawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi sia in Elisha thin uuksak a, ama in kumpipa munah, “Nga vei lukvei bang na saat tu hi ve, tua hile Syria te zo siat tu ve teh, tu in amate thumvei bekma zo tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Elisha thi in ama kiphum hi. Kum simin Moab te in a hon veu in Israel ngam sim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khatvei mithi khat a kivui laitakin tua ngalte honkhat kingal mu a, tuaciang mithi puate in a thiluang sia Elisha ii thaan sungah lawnsuk uh a, amate taikeak uh hi. Elisha ii ngu taw a kiphak po ciang mithi sia nungta kik a, ding to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Syria Kumpipa Hazael in Jehoahaz ii maan sung theampo Israel nengcip ngawp a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />ahizong Topa in amate tungah thuthiamin hesuak hi. Amate a kimaimot mang tu oai ngawlin, hu zaw hi, banghang ziam cile Abraham, Isaac le Jacob te tungah thuciamna a vawt hang ahi hi. Ama in a mite mangil ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Syria Kumpipa Hazael a thi ciang a tapa Benhadad kumpi suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Israel Kumpipa Jehoash in Benhadad sia thumvei zo zo a, tuaciang a pa Jehoahaz ii khan lai a Benhadad ii suan sa khuapite ama in la kik hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel te Kumpipa Jehoahaz ii tapa Jehoash ii maan zawk a kum nii na ciang, Joash ii tapa Amaziah sia Judah te kumpipa suak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama kum 25 pha a, ama in Jerusalem panin kum 29 sung uk hi. A nu sia Jerusalem pan a Jehoaddin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in Topa ii diksak bangin ngamta a, ahihang ama sia a taanghpupi David bang hi ngawlin, a pa Joash ii ngamtat bangin ngamta zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in doai biakna munte baltham ngawl a, tuaciang mihingte in sangaw biakpiakna le ngimnamtui halna te tua munah zom to suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaziah in a thuneina a kip po ciang, a pa kumpipa a that uliante thatsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang ama in tuate ii tate thatlum ngawl a, Moses Thukham sungah Topa ii thupiak ahi: “A tate ii a vawt khialnate hu in nute pate kithisak ngawl tu a, pate nute ii a vawt khialnate hu in tate kithisak ngawl tu hi; mihing khat sia ama ii khialna hang bekin kithisak tu hi,” a cite zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaziah in Edom ngalkapte 10,000 sia Ci Kuam sungah that hi; ama in Sela khuapi sia kidona sungah suan a, Joktheel ci in a min phuak a, tu dong ma tua min pua lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang Amaziah in Israel te Kumpipa Jehoash tungah kamtaite paisakin kido natu thato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang Kumpipa Jehoash in hi bang zo kikna thaak kik hi: “Khatvei lai in lingkung khat Lebanon Mual tungah a om sia in cedar kung khat ii munah: ‘Na tanu sia ka tapa ii zi tu hong pia ta'n,’ ci hi. Ngamsa khat hong pai in lingkung sia tuanhcil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu in Amaziah awng, nang in Edom te na zaw hu in kisathei ni hi. Na minthanna taw lungkim in a, inn ah om po in. Nang le na mite lalna bek hong pia tu ngimna banghangin piangsak nuam ni ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang Amaziah in ngai nuam ngawl hi, tua ahikom Kumpipa Jehoash in a mite taw kuanin Judah ngam Beth Shemesh ah kido uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaziah ii ngalkap honte in lel a, a ngalkap te theampo amate inn tek ah tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jehoash in Amaziah sia manin thongtaaksak hi, Jerusalem ah paisuak in a khuapi ii luphung sia Ephraim Kongpi pan A Kiing Kongpi dong metre 200 dektak kikaal sung teng baltham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in ngunn le khamh a mu theampo, biakinn vanh theampo le kumpi inn sungah sumngum te la in Samaria ah ciapui hi. Ama in mihing pawlkhat zongh a kitan kik tu in ciapui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jehoash ii a sep a vawt dangte theampo, kumpipa Amaziah taw a kidona sungah a hannate huamin, Israel te ii Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehoash thi a, ama sia Samaria khua kumpi thaan ah kiphum hi, tuaciang a tapa Jeroboam II in ama ii kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel Kumpipa Jehoash ii thi zawk kum sawm le kum nga dong Judah te kumpipa Amaziah nungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaziah ii a sep a vawt dangte theampo sia Judah te Kumpipate ii Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaziah suamlup natu in Jerusalem ah sawmna khat om hi, tua ahikom ama sia Laschish khuapi ah tai hi, ahihang a ngalte in tua munah zuizen in thatlum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A luang sia siphu khat tungah suanh in Jerusalem ah ciapui uh hi, David khuapi kumpi thaan ah ama kiphum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Judah mite in a tapa kum sawm le kum luk a pha Uzziah sia kumpilukhu khusakin kumpi suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pa thi zawkciang Uzziah in Elath khua suan kikin sa kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Judah te kumpipa Joash ii tapa Amaziah maan zawk a kum sawm le kum nga kum in Jehoash ii tapa Jeroboam sia Israel te ii kumpipa suak hi, tuaciang ama in Samaria pan kum 41 sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in, Israel sia mawna sungah a then, ama mai ah a seam masa Nebat ii tapa Kumpipa Jeroboam ii a ngitlo ngamtatna teng zui in Topa tungah maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in Israel te ii neisa ngamkhen theampo, saksang pan Hammath Mualciangh, thangsang pan Tuipi Thi dong zo kik hi. Hisia in Jonah Gath Hepher khua pan a kamsaangpa Amittai ii tapa Oonah tungah Topa, Israel te ii Pathian ii a kamciamsa sia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa in Israel te ii a cizathuai mama thuakna sia mu hi; tuaciang amate a hu tu kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahihang Israel te a bo cimit tu sia Topa ii tupna hi ngawl hi. Tua ahikom ama in amate sia Kumpipa Jeroboam II tungtawnin suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jeroboam II ii a sep a vawt dangte theampo, ngal sung a hanna le Damascus le Hamath khuate, Israel te atu a laak kikna theampo sia Israel Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jeroboam thi a, kumpi thaan ah kiphumin, tuaciang a tapa Zechariah in a kumpi za lua hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Jeroboam II kumpi a sep zawk a kum 27 kumin Amaziah tapa Uzziah sia Judah te kumpipa suak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama kum sia kum sawm le kum luk pha in, Jerusalem pan kum 52 sung uk hi. A nu sia Jerusalem pan a Jecoliah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa ii ngamtatna zui in ama in Topa ii diksak bangin ngamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang doai biate ii biakna munte kisusia ngawl a, mihingte in sangaw biakpiakna le ngimnamtui halnate tua munah vawt suak lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Uzziah sia a kiitakhuai vun natna taw vaat a, a thi dong tua natna vei hi. Ama in ama ii aituam inn khat ah teang a, a vaipuak theampo kipengsakin, a tapa Jotham in ngam uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Uzziah ii a sep a vawt dangte theampo sia Judah Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Uzziah thi a, David ii khuapi sung kumpi thaan ah kivui a, a tapa Jotham in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Uzziah maan zawk a kum 38 kumin Israel te ii kumpipa Jeroboam II ii tapa Zechariah sia Israel te ii kumpipa suak a, tuaciang ama in Samaria pan tha luk sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in, ama mai ah a seam masa te bangma in Topa tungah maw hi. Ama in Nebat ii tapa kumpipa Jeroboam ngitlo ngamtat sia teng zui in, Israel te mawna sungah lampui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jabesh ii tapa Shallum in Kumpipa Zechariah suam tu a sawm bangin Ibleam ah thatlum hi, tuaciang a kumpi za ama in lua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zechariah ii sep le vawt a dangte theampo sia Israel Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa ii Kumpipa Jehu tungah kamciam a piak, “Na suan na paalte khang li dong Israel kumpipate suak tu hi,” a ci sia taangtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Uzziah a maan zawk a kum 39 kumin, Jabesh ii tapa Shallum sia Israel te ii kumpipa suak hi, tuaciang ama in Samaria pan tha khat sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gadi ii tapa Menahem in Tirzah pan Samaria ah pai a, Shallum suamlum in a kumpi za lua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Shallum ii a sep a vawt dangte theampo, a ngual suamna thute a kihel in Israel Kumpipate ii Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Menahem in Tirzah panin a pai ciangin Tappuah khuapi, a sungah a teangte le a kiim a paam ngamkhen teng susia cip hi, banghang ziam cile ama tungah ki aap ngawl hi. Nau ngai numeite theampo ii ngilpi ngawngawn khuakeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Uzziah ii maan zawk a kum 39 kum in Gadi ii tapa Menahem sia Israel te ii Kumpipa suak hi, tuaciang ama in Samaria pan kum sawm sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in, a thi dong Israel te mawna sungah a lampui Nebat ii tapa kumpipa Jeroboam tatsiatna teng zui in, Topa tungah maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Assyria te ii kumpilianpa Tiglath Pileser in Israel sim a, tuaciang Menahem in, ngam sungah ama ii vaangletna a kip natu tua kumpipa ii panpui natu in ngunn kilogramme 34,000 pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Menahem in tua dangka te sia Israel ngam ah mihaute khat sim tung pan ngunntang 50 tek zawthawk thu taw khonin a nga ahi hi. Tua ahikom Tiglath Pileser sia ama ngam ah cia kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Menahem ii a sep a vawt dangte theampo sia Israel Kumpite ii Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama thi in kiphum a, a tapa Pekahiah in ama kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Uzziah ii maan zawk a kum 50 kumin Menahem ii tapa Pekahiah sia Israel te ii kumpipa suak hi, tuaciang ama in Samaria panin kum nii sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in, Israel sia mawna sungah a lampui Nebat ii tapa Kumpipa Jeroboam ii ngitlo ngamtat teng zui in, Topa tungah maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pekahiah ii ngalkap ulian khat ahi Remaliah ii tapa Pekah in Gilead khua pan mihing 50 taw ama thasawmin, Samaria kumpi inn a sungnung kulh sungah Pekahiah sia suamlum a, ama in a kumpi za lua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pekahiah ii a sep a vawt dangte theampo Israel Kumpipate ii Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Judah Kumpipa Uzziah ii a maan zawk a kum 52 kumin Remaliah ii tapa Pekah sia Israel te kumpipa suak a, ama in Samaria ah kum kul sung maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in Israel te mawna sungah a lampui Nebat ii tapa Kumpipa Jeroboam ii ngitlo ngamtatna teng zui in, Topa tungah maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pekah kumpipa ahi hun laitakin Assyria te ii kumpilianpa Tiglath Pileser in, Ijon, Abel Beth Maacah, Janoah, Kedesh le Hazor khuapi teng le Gilead ii ngamkhen, Galilee le Naphtali teng suan hi, tuaciang a mihingte sia Assyria ah thongtaak tu in ciapui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Uzziah ii tapa Jotham ii maan zawk a kum kul lai in Elah ii tapa Hoshea in kumpipa Pekah sia thasawmin, suamlup zawkciang a kumpi za sia ama in lua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pekah ii a sep a vawt dangte theampo sia Israel Kumpipate ii Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Remaliah ii tapa Pekah ii Israel kumpi in a maan zawk a kum nii kumin Uzziah ii tapa Jotham sia Judah te kumpipa suak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />ama ii kum sia kum 25 pha a, Jerusalem panin kum sawm le kum luk sung uk hi. A nu sia Zadok ii tanu Jerusha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A pa Uzziah ii ngamtatna zui in Jotham in Topa ii diksak te ngamtatna in nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahihang doai biate ii biakna munte kisusia ngawl hi, tuaciang mihingte in sangaw biakpiakna le ngimnamtui halna te tua munah vawt suak lai uh hi. Biakinnpi ii Saksang Kongpi a sa sia Jotham ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jotham ii sep le vawt a dangte theampo sia Judah Kumpipate ii Taanghthu sungah kikhum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama kumpipa ahi laitakin Topa in Judah te sim tu in Syria te kumpipa Rezin puak masa a, tuaciang Israel te kumpipa Pekah puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jotham thi a David ii Khuapi sung kumpi thaan ah kiphumin a tapa Ahaz in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Remaliah ii tapa Israel te ii kumpipa Pekah ii maan zawk kum sawm le kum sali kum in Jotham ii tapa Ahaz sia Judah te kumpipa suak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama kum kul pha a, Jerusalem panin kum sawm le kum luk sung uk hi. Ama in a taanghpupi David ii ngamtatna phate zui ngawl a; Topa Pathian ii diksak ngawlte vawt zaw hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuaciang ama in Israel kumpipate ii ngamtatna te veu zui hi. Ama in, Israel mite hong mainawt uh lai in, Topa ii a ngamsung pan a nawkeakte ii a thasiathuai ngamtatnate zui a, a tapa ngawngawn milim biakna meihal biakpiakna in nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Doai biate ii biakna mun, mualte ii tung, le thinglim nuai sim ah, Ahaz in sangaw biakpiakna le ngimnamtui halnate piakhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Syria te kumpipa Rezin le Israel kumpipa Pekah in Jerusalem sim a, uumci ahihang Ahaz sia zo zo ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />(Tua hun sung ma in Edom te kumpipa in Elath khuapi la kik a, Judah mi tua munah a teangte notkeak hi. Edom te Elath a teang a, teang top lai uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahaz in Assyria te ii kumpilianpa Tiglath Pileser munah kamtaite paisak a: “Keima in a thumaan na naseampa khi hi. Hong pai ta'n a, Syria le Israel kumpipate khut sung pan hong hun khia ta'n, amate in kei hong sim hi.” cisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahaz in ngunn le khamhte Biakinn pan le kumpi inn sung sum kholna pan la in, kumpilianpa tungah letsong in thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahaz ii maangkaa na a zona in Tiglath Pileser in a ngalkap hon taw Damascus ah kuan in, tua khuapi suan a, kumpipa Rezin thatlum in a mite sia thongtaak tu in Kir khua ah paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahaz in Damascus ah Kumpilianpa Tiglath Pileser taw kimu tu in a pai ciang, tua munah a om biaknatau sia mu hi, ama in tua biaknatau ii lim sia kheet nei ngawlin a kicing tatakin suai a, Uriah thiampipa thaak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahikom Uriah in biaknatau tuasia taw a kibang linlian khat vawtsak a, Ahaz hong heak kik ma in man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Damascus pan hong cia kik ciang Ahaz in biaknatau sia a kiman sa in mu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tua ahikom ama in nganhingte taw sangaw biakpiakna le antang biakpiakna tua biaknatau tungah vawt a, tuaciang sapittui biakna le kipawlkhop biakpiakna chi te bungh suk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Taau taw kivawt biaknatau Topa tungah a ki aapsa sia biaknatau thak le Biakinnpi kilaklaw ah koi uh a, tua ahikom Ahaz in biaknatau thak sia ii saksang ah khiin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in Uriah munah, “Hi keima aa ahi biaknatau lian sia zingsang meihal biakpiakna le nitak antang biakpiakna, kumpipa le a mipite meihal biakpiakna le antang biakpiak natu le mipite ii sapittui biakpiak natu in zangh in. Nganhing sangaw biakpiakna a kizangh theampo ii chi sia a tungah sung in. Ahihang taau biaknatau sia keima ii aisaanna ah ka zak tu in na koi in,” ci in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Uriah in kumpipa thupiak bangin seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa Ahaz in Biakinnpi sungah a kizangh taau leang sia a tuamin la a, tua tungah a om kuangpuite heam hi; ama in taau khuital sawm le nii te nungzaang pan taau tuikuangte zongh la in suangtum doppha tungah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Assyria te kumpilianpa a lungkimsak natu in Ahaz in Biakinnpi sung pan kumpi tokhum koina dawtuam sia heamkhia in, kumpipa ii Biakinnpi sung aituam tumna bangkua zongh khakbil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahaz Kumpipa ii a sep a vawt dangte theampo sia Judah Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahaz thi a, David Khuapi sung kumpi thaan ah kiphumin, a tapa Hezekiah in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah ah kumpipa Ahaz a maan zawk a kum sawm le kum nii kumin Elah ii tapa Hoshea sia Israel te kumpipa suak a, ama in Samaria pan kum kua sung uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Topa tungah maw a, ahizong ama mai ah Israel a uk kumpipa dangte za in maw ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Assyria kumpilianpa Shalmaneser in ama tungah ngal phuang hi; Hoshea in Shalmaneser tungah tum in, kum simin shia pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang Hoshea in kum khat ciang, Egypt kumpipa So tungah hu ngen tu in kamtai paisak hi, tuaciang Assyria te tungah shia a piak sia tawp hi. Shalmaneser in hi thu a heak ciang Hoshea mansak in thong sungah khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Shalmaneser in Israel simin Samaria uumci hi. A uumci zawk a kum thum kum,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hoshea ii maan zawk a kum kua a phak kumin Assyria te ii kumpilianpa in Samaria suan hi, Israel te thongtaak tu in ciapui a, tuate sung pan pawlkhat sia Halah khuapi ah, pawlkhat sia Gozan ngamkhen sung Habor Ngun hui ah, tuaciang pawlkhat sia Media te khuapite ah teangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Samaria khua bona sia Egypt ngam panin amate a pusua pui, Egypt kumpipa khut sung pan a hunkhia Topa a Pathian tungah a maw uh hang ahi hi. Amate in pathian dangte bia uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a mite ii a mainawt ciang Topa ii a nawkeak mite ii ngeina te zui pui in, Israel kumpipate ii a piansak tawm ngeinate zuisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel te in Topa a Pathian ii thukimpui ngawl nate seam uh hi. Amate in doai biate ii biakna munte khua theampo, khuanobel pan khuapi lianbel dongah sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mualtung theampo le thinglim nuai sim ah, Asherah numeipathian ii milim le suangkhuamte phut uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuaciang, Topa ii a ngam pan a betkeak mihingte ii ngamtatna zui in amate in ngimnamtuite doai biate tau tungah hal uh hi. Amate in Topa thin uuk natu in amate ii ngitlo ngamtatna te taw piangsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />milim biak ngawl natu Topa ii thupiakte ni ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in a kamtai te le a kamsaangte paisakin Israel le Judah te a kidop natu in sawl a: “Na ngamtat siatna uhte nusia vun a, na taanghpupite uh ka piak Thukhamte sungah a om, ka naseam ka kamsaangte tungtawnin no tungah kong piak kong sawlna te ni vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang amate in a thu ni ngawl uh hi; Topa a muang ngawl a taanghpupite uh bangma in thinpui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama ii hilnate nit tu nial hi, a taanghpupite taw thuciamna a vawtte zongh keam ngawl uh a, kidop natu a piakte zongh thu in sim ngawl uh hi. Amate in a mannung ngawl milimte bia uh a, amate mama zongh a mannung ngawl suak uh hi, amate in a kiim a paam ah mite ii ngeinate zui uh a, Topa ii zui heak vun ci in a thupiakna sia ni ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa a Pathian ii thukham theampo amate in paltan uh a, amate in thik taw a kivawt khuital nii ii lim a biak tu in vawt uh hi; amate in Asherah numeipathian ii milim zongh vawt a, aksite bia in, Baal pathian ii naseam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in a tapa a tanute doai biate ii pathiante tungah meihal biakpiakna in pia uh hi; amate in thaa sam theite le aisaan theite thu dongh uh hi, tuaciang amate in Topa ii muna ah a maan ngawlte vawt tu in kipum aap uh a, Topa thin uukna piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa sia Israel tungah thin uuk ahikom ama ii mu na pan bengkeak a, Judah kumpi ngam bek khe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihang Judah mite ngawngawn in zongh Topa a Pathian ii thukhamte ni ngawl uh a; Israel te ii ngeina a zak uhte zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in Israel te nial in, daan pia a, a ngilo ngalte khut sungah aap hi, a khakbel ciang ama ii muna pan bengkeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in Israel le Judah a khen zawkciang Israel te in Nebat ii tapa Jeroboam sia kumpi suaksak uh hi. Jeroboam in Israel te a Topa taisansak in a kiitakhuai mama mawna sungah then hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in Jeroboam zui in ama ii mawna a vawt theampo vawt paisuak uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a naseam kamsaangte tungah Topa ii ka vawt tu hi ci in a kidop natu a sonkhol bangin a khakbel ciang ama ii mu na pan betkeakna a thuak uh dong amate in mawna vawt uh hi. Tua ahikom Israel mite sia Assyria ah sal in kiciapui a, tu ni dong tua munah teang lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Assyria kumpilianpa in Babylon, Cuth, Ivvah, Hamath le Sepharvaim khuapite pan mihingte paipui in, saltaang Israel te ii teenna mun Samaria te khuapite ah teangsak hi. Hi khuapite, amate ii neisa sua in tua munah teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate tua munah a ten phit sawngin Topa bia ngawl uh ahikom Topa in tawpi te puakin, amate pawlkhat thatlumsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Assyria te ii kumpilianpa munah, Samaria khuapite ah mihing a teensakte in tua ngam ii pathian thukhamte he ngawl ahikom a pathian in tawpi puakin thatsak hi, ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahikom kumpilianpa in: “Thiampi ih ciapui thongtaak te sung pan khat puak kik vun a; a ngam ii pathianzia a mite tungah a hil tu in tua munah cia kik in teangsak vun,” ci in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahikom Samaria pan a kihawlkhia Israel thiampi khat sia pai in, Bethel ah teang a, tua mun pan Topa bangbangin bia tu ci in a mihingte hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahihang Samaria ah a teang mite in amate ii milim tek ma vawt suak uh a, Israel te ii vawt sa biakpiakna buk sungah koi uh hi. A kibang ngawl pawl tuatuam sim in amate ii teenna khuapite ah a milimte vawt tek uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Babylon mite in Succoth Benoth pathian ii milimte vawt a; Cuth mite in Nergal pathian milimte; Hamath mite in Ashima milimte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ivvah mite in Nibhaz le Tartak milimte; tuaciang Sepharvaim mite in a pathian uh Adrammelech le Anammelech tungah meihal biakpiakna in a tate pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hi mite in Topa zongh bia uh hi, tuaciang doai biate ii biakna munte sangaw biakpiakna munte ah thiampi seam tu le amate taangin sangaw biakpiakna a pia tu in amate sung pan mi tuatuamte teal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuabangin amate in Topa bia uh a, ahihang amate hong paina a ngamte ii ngeinate bangma in amate tek ii pathiante zongh bia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate in a ngeina luite tu ni dongin zom suak lai uh hi. Amate in Topa bia ngawl a, Israel ci in min a piak Jacob ii suan le paalte tung a piak thukham le thupiaknate zongh ni ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa in amate taw thuciamna vawt in, “A dang pathiante bia ngawl tu nu hi; tuate mai ah kun ngawl tu nu hi tuaciang a na seam ngawl tu nu hi, tua ahibuale zong sangaw biakpiakna pia ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />No te Egypt ngam pan vaangletna le thahatna taw hong pusuapui keima Topa ii thu hong ni tu nu hi, note kei mai ah hong kun tu nu hi, tuaciang sangaw biakna zongh hong pia tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Note a tu ka at thukhamte le thupiakte a tawntungin ni tu nu hi. A dang pathiante bia ngawl tu nu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />tuaciang no taw thuciam ka vawtte mangil ngawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Keima Topa , na Pathian ii thu nong ni tu uh a, tuasia ciang, na ngalte kung pan kong suatak tu hi,” ci in thupia hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahihang tua mite in ngai ngawl uh a, amate ii ngeina luite ma zui veve uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua hi a, tua mite in Topa bia uh hi, ahihang amate ii a milimte zongh bia uh hi; tuni dong ma in a suan a paalte in tuabangin ngamta lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel ah Elah ii tapa Hoshea ii maan zawk a kum thum kum Ahaz ii tapa Hezekiah sia
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama kum 25 a phak laitakin Judah te ii Kumpipa suak a, Jerusalem panin kum 29 sung uk hi. A nu sia Zechariah tanu Abijah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A taanghpupi David ii ngamtatna zui in ama in Topa ii diksak tu in ngamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in doai biate ii biakpiakna munte sutham hi, suangkhuamte sutan in, tuaciang numeipathian Asherah limte zongh sattan siat hi. Moses ii vawt taau ngul, Nehushtan a kici sia zongh sutham hi. Tua hun dong sia Israel mite in tua taaungul upat vawtna in ngimnamtui hal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hezekiah in Topa Israel te ii Pathian muang hi; Judah mite in ama ii hun ma hikale ama ii hun zawkciang hikale ama taw a kibang kumpipa nei ngeingawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Topa tungah thumaan in, bangma hunin a thu ni ngawlin a om ngei bua hi, Topa ii Moses tungah a piak thupiakna te phinciing takin keamcing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa sia ama taw omkhawm a, tuaciangin ama sia a sep a vawt theampo ah zawna nga hi. Ama in Assyria te ii kumpilianpa langpanin leedo a ama khutnuai ah tum nuam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Philistine te zo in, Gaza le a kiim a paam ngamte kihel amate ii teenna khuanobel te pan kipan khuapi lianbel te dong kuanin sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hezekiah ii a maan zawk a kum li kum ciang — tuasia Israel te tungah kumpipa Hoshea ii maan zawk a kum sali kum hi a — Assyria te ii Kumpilianpa Shalmaneser in Israel simin Samaria uumci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A uumci zawk a kum thum kum ciangin Samaria khua bo a; Hezekiah ii maan zawk a kum lukna hi a, Hoshea ii maan zawk a kum kua kum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Assyria te ii kumpilianpa in Israel te thongtaak tu in paipui a, pawlkhat sia Halah khuapi sungah, pawlkhat Gozan ngamkhen sung Habor Ngun hui ah, pawlkhat sia Media te khuapite ah teangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Samaria khua bo hi, banghang ziam cile Israel in Topa a Pathian ii thu ni ngawl hi, tua banah amate taw thuciam a vawt te zongh paltan uh a, Topa naseampa Moses ii thukham a piakte theampo zongh ni ngawl uh hi. Amate in za nuam ngawl a, ni nuam ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa Hezekiah ii a maan zawk a kum sawm le kum li ciangin, Assyria te ii kumpilianpa Sennacherib in Judah te ii kulh taw a ki uum khuapite simin zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hezekiah in Lachish a om Sennacherib tungah, “Keima in seam khial zo khi hi; nong hesuakna in hong sim nawn heak in, nong nget pawpo kong pia tu hi,” ci in kamthaak hi. Kumpilianpa in zo kik a, Hezekiah in ngunn kilogramme 10,000 le khamh kilogramme tulkhat ama a puak tu in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hezekiah in Biakinnpi sung le kumpi inn sumkholna sungah ngunn teng thaak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ama in Biakinnpi kongbiang khuamte tung pan khamhte zongh khokin, tuaciang ama mama ii kongbiang khuamte a tuamna khamhte la in Sennacherib thaak siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Assyria kumpilianpa in ngalkaphon lian khat Jerusalem ah Hezekiah sim tu in paisak hi; tua ngalkaphonpi sia ama ii uliante a za lianbel thum teng in uksak hi. Amate Jerusalem a thet uh ciangin, amate in tuili tungnung sia pan tui hong luanna hawkluam sia ii hui ah a om puantak naseamte ii omna lampi sia lua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaciang amate in Hezekiah samsak uh hi, tuaciang ama ii uliante thum in amate taw kisi tu in pai uh hi: tuate sia kumpi inn a keam pa Hilkiah ii tapa Eliakim, zum lai atpa Shebna; le thu tepteena teng a uk Asaph ii tapa Joah ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Assyria uliante khat in, kumpipa Hezekiah sia a bang teng in hi zata in ngammuangsak thei ziam ci sia kumpilianpa in he nuam hi, ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in, “Ngalkap lam sang thiamna le hatna te sia kam le muk taw kizo thei hi ci in um nu ziam? Assyria te nong leedo uh sia akua in hong hu tu in um nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Egypt te in no hong hu tu in um nu hi, ahihang tua ngaisutna sia pumpa kung ciangkhut in zak taw kibang tu hi — hong tal tu a, na khut uh hong sun tu hi. Egypt kumpipa sia ama a suang pawpo atu tuasia taw kibang hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Assyria ulianpa in, “Tua ahibuale zong noma in na Topa Pathian uh suang nu ziam? Topa ii biakpiakna bukte le biaknataute a sutham sia Hezekiah hi, ama in Judah mite tungah Jerusalem biaknatau bekma ah biakpiakna vawt thei tu nu hi, ci in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kumpilianpa min taw thukimna khat no taw ka vawt tu hi. A tungah a to tu mihing tuaza in a tam na mu zo uh le siphu tulnii hong pia tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />No sia Assyria te sung pan a za nobel sia taw zong kitee ngat thei ngawl lai nu hi, hi napi Egypt te in siphu ngalleang le siphu ngalkapte puak tu in na muangmaw uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa ii hong huna kihel ngawlin na ngam uh sim tu in hong um nu ziam? Topa ama mama in simin susia in ci in kei hong sawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Eliakim, Shebna le Joah in ulian pa munah, “Aramaic kam in hong pau ta'n, topa awng, tua kam tel khu hi. Hebrew kam in hong pau heak vun, luphung tungah a to mite theampo in hong ngai hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in zo kik a, “Kumpilianpa in hite theampo sia no le na kumpipa zaak tu bek in son a hong sawl sa nu ziam? Hi ngawl hi, noma bang keakin, a eak uh ne a, a zun uh a dawn tu, luphung tungah a to te ii zaak tu in ka pau ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ulian pa hong dingto in Hebrew kam in hong au hi, “Assyria kumpilianpa ii hong son teng ngai vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in Hezekiah ii hong theam ngawl natu kidopna hong pia hi. Hezekiah in no hong hun zo ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa a suang tu in ama in zolsak zo heak vun. Topa in no hong hun tu in um heak vun, tuaciang Assyrian ngalkapte ii na khuapi hong lak tu hong khak zo tu um nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hezekiah ii thu son ngai heak vun. Assyria te kumpilianpa in, khuapi panin hong pusuak tavun a hong tum tavun ci in thu hong pia hi. Noma sapitkungte panin sapitte hong kinesak tu a, na thingkung uhte panin thei ngate hong kinesak tu hi, tuaciang na tuikhuk uh pan tui hong kidawnsak tu hi —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tua teng sia kumpilianpa ii note teen kik natu ngam hong piak dong hi tu a, tua ngam sia noma ngam taw ma kibang tu hi, sapittui na neak natu uh sapithuan om a, anluum vawt natu antang om tu hi: tua ngam sia olive kung le olive thau, le khuaitui omna ngam hi. Ama ii hong thupiak bangin na ngamta uh le na thi buatu uh a, na nungta tu uh hi. Topa in note hong suatak tu hi ci in Hezekiah in theamsak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ngamdangte ii pathiante in zongh a ngam uh sia Assyria kumpilianpa ii khut sung pan hunkhia ngei na ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate tu in koisungah om ziam? Hamath le Arpad ii pathiante, koisungah om ziam? Sepharvaim, Hena, le Ivvah te ii pathiante koisungah om ziam? Samaria akua in hun ngei ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ko ii kumpilianpa khut sung pan hi pathiante khat pawpo in hi ngamte hun ngei ka na ziam? Tua ahile Topa in Jerusalem hun thei tu hi ci in bang in hong ngaisunsak ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mihingte sia kumpipa Hezekiah ii sawl bangma in dai khipkhep in om uh a; amate in kam khat zongh pau ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuaciangin Eliakim Shebna le Joah te in heena taw a puansilh uh baltham uh a, tuaciangin Assyria ulian pa ii pauna teng kumpipa munah son uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa Hezekiah in amate ii a puak thu a zaak po ciang he mama in a puansilh eaukeak in, khau-ip puan silhin Topa Biakinnpi sungah tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in kumpi inn a keam pa Eliakim, zum lai at pa Shebna le thiampi uhaam pa sia Amoz ii tapa kamsaangpa Isaiah kungah paisak hi. Amate theampo zongh khau-ip puan silh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate ii Isaiah tungah kammal thaak tu a piak sia hi teng hi. “Tuni sia haksatna ih thuak ni hi; ei hong kidaantat a, hong kimaimawlsak hi. Ei sia numei khat nausuak tu kipan ahihang tha mama nei ngawl khat taw ih kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Assyria kumpilianpa in ama ii ulianbel pa a nungta Pathian a selno tu in hong paisak hi. Na Topa Pathian in hi a selnonate za hen a, tuabang a paute daan pia tahen. Tua ahikom Pathian tungah ih mihingte a nungta lai teng atu thu ngen in,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isaiah in kumpipa Hezekiah ii kamthaak teng a nga ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ama in, “ Topa in nang hong hun thei bo a ci, Assyria te ii pauna te in pautausak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in kumpilianpa sia a ngam ah a ciakik natu kamleang khat zasak tu hi, ama tua munah kithat lumsak tu hi, ci in Topa in nang hong son hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Assyria ulian pa in kumpilianpa sia Lachish khua nusia in a nai na Libnah khuapi ah ngaldo hi ci in za hi; tua ahikom ama in ama taw kamkum tu in pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Egypt te ngalkap honte Ethiopia kumpipa Tirhakah in lampui in amate sim tu hi ci in Assyria te in thu za uh hi. Kumpilianpa in hi thu a zaak ciang ama in Judah te kumpipa Hezekiah tung ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Na muanna Pathian in nang sia kei khut sungah taak ngawl tu ni hi hong ci hi, ahihang tua in nang theamsak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Assyria kumpilianpa khat in ama ii siatsak nop ngam khat pawpo sia bang law ziam na zaaksa hi. Nang suakta thei tu ki um ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka taanghpupite in khuapite ahi Gozan, Haran le Rezeph te susia a, Telasar a teang Bethedan mite zongh mon hi, amate ii pathiante in hun thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hamath, Arpad, Sepharvaim, Hena le Ivvah khuapi te ii a kumpipate koi sungah om ziam?” ci in lai khat thak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaciang Hezekiah in kamtaipa tung pan a laithak sia la in sim hi. Tua zawkciang ama Biakinnpi sungah tumin Topa ii ompuina ah laithak sia koi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuaciang, “Cherubim te ii tungsia na tokhum tungah a to, Topa Israel te ii Pathian awng, nang bekma Pathian na hi hi, leitung kumpi ngam theampo a uk pa na hi hi. Nangma in lei le van na bitphua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu in Topa awng, ko tungah thu hong piangte en in. Nang a nungta Pathian hong selnona Sennacherib ii pau teng ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa awng, Assyria te kumpilianpa in ngam tam mama susia a, a leitangte ngamkhing in omsak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuaciang pathian hi ngawl het a, mihing khut bek taw a kivawt thing le suang milim ahi, a pathian uhte haltham ahi hunlam kote theampo in he khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu in, Topa ka Pathian awng, Assyria te kung panin hong hun ta'n, tuasia ciang leitung ngamte theampo in nang, Topa bek Pathian na hi hunlam hong he tu hi,” ci in thungen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Isaiah in Kumpipa Hezekiah tungah kumpipa ii thungetna a zo kikna teng sia
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in, “Sennacherib awng, Jerusalem khuapi in nang hong nuisan hi, hong thusim ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nang in akua thusim ngawl a, akua selno in kingaisun ni ziam? Nang in kei, Israel ii a thiangtho Pathian nong zatak vawt bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na siphu ngalleangte taw Lebanon mualsaangbel te na zawthalna thu kisuangtaak tu in kei kungah na kamtai te nong paisak hi. Nangma in cedar thingkung saangbelte le cypress thing phabelte ka phuktan a, dui thuk belna mun ka theng hi ci in na kisuangtaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ngamdang ah tuikhuk to in tui ka dawn hi na ci a, na ngalkapte in Nile ngun tuanh in kosak hi ci in na kisuangtaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Hi teng sia khuangeipi lai in ka ngeal sa ahi hunlam za ngeingawl ni ziam? Tuciangin tuasia taaksua zo khi hi. Kulh taw a ki uum khuapite niinthuk kikholte suaksak tu in thahatna kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua munah a teang mihingte sia thahatna nei ngawl hi; amate lau in khing liang uh hi. Amate sia lo sungah lopate ahibuale nisuana pan vuisa ii seam keak innkhum tungah a po lopate taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ahihang nang huvau theampo, bang vawt a koi sungah pai, ci in kong he hi. Kei hong langpanin na kitom ngawp kong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua na kitomna thu le na kiphatsakna hong kikona te ka za hi, tu in na naak pailet in thikkoai kong thaak tu a, na kam sungah kamkhau kong khii tu hi, nong paina lampi sia ma tawnin kong leekai kik tu hi,” a ci teng sonsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Isaiah in Kumpipa Hezekiah munah, “Hong piang tu thu ii lim sia hisia hi. Tu kum le mai ciangin ngamh ante bek na ne tu uh hi, ahizong a kum kik ciang na ciin sa uh ante na at tu a, na suan sa uh sapitngate na ne tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Judah ngam ah a luhai lai teng sia thingno bangin khang tu a, lei ah zung thuk tha in, a nga bangin nopci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jerusalem ah mite om tu a, Zion Mual ah a luhai in om tu hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in hisia a pian natu khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Assyria kumpilianpa huvau Topa ii ci sia hisia hi: ‘Ama in hi khuapi sungah tum ngawl tu a, thaltang khat zongh hi khuapi ngatin kap ngawl tu hi. Lum toai ngalkap khat zongh in hi khuapi hong neak ngawl tu a, tuaciang a uumci natu in a kiim ah leivum khat zongh kivawt ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama hi khuapi sungah tum ngawlin hong paina lampi ma tawnin heak kik tu hi, Keima, Topa pau zo khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Keima vaang atu le ka naseampa David tungah ka kamciamna hangin hi khuapi sia dal in hung tu khi hi’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua zanin Topa vantunglalang khat Assyria te ngiaphual ah pai in ngalkap 185,000 thatlum hi. A zingsang khuavak ciang amate a thisa in tua munah liik siat hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Assyria kumpilianpa Sennacherib nungkin in Nineveh khua ah heak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ni khat ni in ama in a pathian Nisroch ii biakinn sungah ama bia in a om laitak a tapate nii, Adrammelech le Sharezer te in a namsau uh taw thatlum hi, tuaciang amate Ararat ngam ah tai in suakta uh hi. A tapa dangkhat Esarhaddon in a za laih a kumpilianpa suak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi hun sung khawngin Kumpipa Hezekiah sia a ciina in thi dektak hi. Amoz ii tapa, kamsaangpa Isaiah in ama taw kimu tu in pai a, ama munah, “ Topa in nang tungah na theampo a kilawm bangin hong koi tahen, banghang ziam cile dam kik ngawl tu ni hi. A thi tu kinging hen hong ci hi,” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hezekiah in a maitang pang sang nga in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“ Topa awng, nang tungah thumaanna le citakna taw in nong oai theampo hanciam in ka sep tawntung sia hong phawk ta'n,” ci in thungen hi. Tuaciang ama nasia takin kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isaiah in kumpipa paisan ahihang kumpi inn leitual laita sia a kaantan ma in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in mite a ukpa Hezekiah kungah Isaiah pai kik in sawl a, ama munah, “Kei, Topa, na taanghpupi David ii Pathian in na thungetna kong za zo a, na thitui luan ka mu zo hi. Nang hong damsak tu khi hi, tuaciang tu zo ni thum ciangin Biakinnpi ah pai tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kum sawm le kum nga hong nungtasak lai tu khi hi. Assyria kumpilianpa khut sung pan nang le hi Jerusalem khuapi sia hong suatak tu khi hi. Keima vaang tu le ka naseampa David tungah kamciam ka piak hu in hi khuapi hung tu khi hi,” ci in sonsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Isaiah in kumpipa a ou te munah theinga panin a kivawt noi thei khat a uilut noai le uhte ama dam tu hi, ci in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa Hezekiah in, “ Topa in hong damsak tu a, ni thum ciangin Biakinnpi ah ka pai thei tu sia bang lim taw tel tu khi ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Isaiah in, “ Topa in a kamciam bang len tu hi ci in hong lakna in lim khat hong pia tu hi. Tu in keallei tungah a limh sia a mai sangah kal sawm paisak tu deizaw ni ziam ahibuale a nungsangah kal sawm nungkinsak nuam zaw ni ziam?” ci kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hezekiah in, “A limh liap sia a mai ah kal sawm paisak tu ol hi! Kal sawm nungkinsak in,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Isaiah in Topa tungah thungen a, Kumpipa Ahaz ii vawt keallei tungah a limh sia kal sawm Topa in nungkinsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua hun khawngma in Babylon kumpi ahi Baladan ii tapa Merodach Baladan in Hezekiah kumpipa ciinat za ahikom ama in lai thaak khat le letsong khat thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hezekiah in tua kamtaite pha takin vaidawn a, tuaciang a hauna teng amate lak hi — ama ii ngunn le khamhte, hel namtuite le paaknamtuite tuaciang a ngal vanh teng lak hi. Ama ii vanh kholna inndoi sung ahizong ama ii kumpi ngam sungah ahizong a lak ngawl vanh khat beak zongh a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kamsaangpa Isaiah sia Hezekiah kumpipa kungah pai in, “Mihing hite koisung pan hong pai a, amate in nang tungah bang hong ci ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Hezekiah in, “Amate ngam khuala mama na Babylon panin hong pai hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Kumpi inn sungah amate in bang teng mu ziam?” ci in dongh hi. “Amate in na theampo mu siat hi. Vanh kholna inndoite sungah ka lak ngawl bangma om ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuasia ciang, Isaiah in kumpipa tungah, “ Topa Vaanglianbelpa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />na kumpi inn sungah vanh om theampo, na taanghpupite ii tuni dong a kholsa theampo Babylon ah a kipuak tu hun khat hong theng tu hi. Bangma kikhe ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangma ii suan le paal tatak te pawlkhat kipaipui tu a, a cil uh kinget in Babylon kumpi inn sungah numei uk kiseamsak tu hi ci hi,” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa Hezekiah in hi teng sia ama ii nuntak sungah ngal kilemna le ngam muanna om tu hi cinopna in saang ahiciangin, “ Topa tung pan nong thu piak teng sia thupha hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hezekiah kumpipa ii a sep a vawt dang teng, a ngal hanna, tuikholna khat a vawtna le khuapi sungah tui a luan natu lei a tawletna thute theampo sia Judah Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hezekiah thi a, a tapa Manasseh in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Manasseh sia Judah kumpipa a sua hunin ama kum sawm le kum nii pha hi, tuaciang ama in Jerusalem panin kum 55 sung uk hi. A nu sia Hephzibah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa ii mite mai sang hong nawk ciang a kinotkeak minamte ii a thasiathuai ngamtatna te zui in Manasseh in Topa tungah maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa Hezekiah ii a suksiatcip sa doai biate ii biakpiakna munte ama in sa kik hi; Israel kumpipa Ahab ii vawt bang keak ma in ama in Baal biak natu biaknataute sa in, Asherah numeipathian ii milim vawt hi. Manasseh in aksite zongh bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Topa ii ama a kibiak natu mun hi a ci Biakinnpi sungah doai sepna taute sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Biakinnpi ii leitualte nii sungah aksite a biak natu biaknatau te vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tapa sia meihal biakpiakna in pia hi. Ama in aisaan le mitbumna zangh in, tuaciang aisaan theite le thaa sam theite kungah thu veu dongh hi. Ama in Topa tungah nasia takin maw a, a thin uukna piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in numeipathian Asherah ii lim sia Biakinnpi sungah koi hi, tua mun sia Topa ii David le a tapa Solomon tungah: “Hi Jerusalem khua ah hi Biakinnpi sung sia kei hong kibiak natu in minam sawm le niite ii ngamsung bup pan ka teal ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaciang Israel mite theampo in ka thupiakna te theampo ni in, ka naseampa Moses ii amate a piak thukham buppi te a keamcing le amate ii taanghpupite tungah ka piak ngam le lei panin a kinawkeak tu ka oai buatu hi,” a cina mun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang Judah mite in Topa thu ni ngawl a, Manasseh in a mite mai sang a nawk hun lai a, Topa ii a nawkeak mite sangin mawna nasia zaw a vawt natu ngawngawn in lampui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A naseam kamsaangte tungtawnin Topa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kumpipa Manasseh in hi a thasiathuai mama nate Canaan mite vawt bang sangin a nasia zaw lai in vawt hi; tuaciang ama ii milimte taw Judah mite mawna sungah lampui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom kei, Israel te Topa , Pathian in Jerusalem le Judah tungah tuasiatna ka piangsak tu a, a za theampo khing liang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samaria daan ka piak bang le Israel kumpipa Ahab le a suan a paalte ka vawt bangin Jerusalem daan ka pia tu hi. Jerusalem sia a mite bo dongin ka nawt siat tu a, a kinawt thiang a khup lam a kikoi pakan khat bangin ka vawt tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A nungta lai teng ka nusia tu a, a ngalte khut sungah ka aap tu hi, tuate in amate zothal tu a, a leitang nopzak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi bangin ka vawt tu sia banghang ziam cile ka mite in kei tungah hong maw a, Egypt ngam pan a taanghpupite ii a pusua pan kipan tuni dong ma ka thin hong uuksak tawntung hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Manasseh in mawna nei ngawl mihing tam mama thatlum a, Jerusalem lampite chisan luang hi; hi teng banah ama in a mite milim biakna ah lampui a, Topa tungah mawsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Manasseh ii sep le vawt a dangte theampo mawna a vawtte theampo kihel in, Judah Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Manasseh thi a, kumpi inn huang sung Uzza huan ah kiphum hi, tuaciang a tapa Amon in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amon sia Judah te kumpipa a sua hunin kum 22 pha a, Jerusalem panin kum nii sung uk hi. A nu sia Meshullemeth hi a, Jotbah khua pan Haruz ii tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pa Manasseh bangma in ama in Topa tungah maw hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ama in a pa ii ngamtatna teng zui in a pa ii biak milimte bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in a taanghpupite ii Pathian, Topa nial a, Topa ii thupiak ni ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amon ii uliante in ama thasawm in, kumpi inn sungah ama thatlum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judah mite in Amon a that teng thatlumin, a tapa Josiah kumpi suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amon ii a sep a vawt dangte theampo Judah Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amon sia Uzza huan sung thaan ah kiphum a, a tapa Josiah in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josiah sia Judah kumpipa a sua hunin kum liat pha hi, tuaciang ama in Jerusalem pan kum 31 sung uk hi. A nu sia Bozkath khua pan Adaiah ii tanu Jedidah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Josiah in Topa ii diksak te vawt hi; ama in a taanghpupi David ii lamlak bangin ngamta a, Pathian thukhamte theampo belcing takin zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa Josiah in a maan zawk kum sawm le kum liat laitakin, Meshullam ii tupa, Azaliah ii tapa zum thuzeakpi Shaphan sia Biakinnpi ah samsak a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Thiampi Lianbelpa Hilkiah kungah pai in a, Biakinnpi tumna a vaipuak nei thiampite ii mipite tung pan a khon sumte bangza pha ziam sazian hong la ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A sum sia Biakinnpi puate a ukte tungah a piak tu in son in. Amate in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />lettamate, inn sate, uksuang ciangte thaman pia in, thing le suang biakinn pua natu a kizangh teng leina in nei tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nasepnate a ukte sia thumaan mama ahikom a sum zakna uh sazian vawtsak kul ngawl hi,” ci in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Shaphan in kumpipa thupiakna teng Hilkiah tungah son a, tuaciang Hilkiah in Biakinnpi sungah Thukham laibu ka mu hi ci in son hi. Hilkiah in tua laibu sia pia a Shaphan in sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama kumpipa kungah pai kik a: “Na naseamte in Biakinnpi sung a om sum teng la in, innpuuate a ukte tungah aap siat zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in, “Hi sungah Hilkiah ii hong piak laibu khat nei khi hi,” ci hi. Tuaciang ama in kumpipa tungah a nging in sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa in laibu a kisim sia thu a zaak ciang, thinnop ngawlna taw a puan eaukeak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuaciang Hilkiah thiampipa, Shaphan tapa Ahikam, Micaiah tapa Achbor, zum thuzeakpi Shaphan te tung le kumpipa koppui pa Asaiah te tungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Pai tavun a, hi laibu ii hong hilna thute Topa tungah keima le Judah mi teng a tu in hong dongh tavun. Topa sia ei tungah thin uuk hi, banghang ziam cile ih taanghpupite in hi laibu ii vawt hamtang tu a ci bangin seam ngawl uh hi,” ci in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem khua ii a khenthak sungah a teang Huldah a kici numei kamsaang khat munah thu dongh tu in, Hilkiah, Ahikam, Achbor, Shaphan le Asaiah te pai uh hi. (A pasal Shallum sia, Tikvah ii tapa, Harhas ii tupa hi a, ama in biakinn sungah a zak puantualte a keampa ahi hi.) Amate in thupiang teng ama munah son uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuaciang ama in amate sia kumpipa kungah cia kikin sawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa ii thupiak hi teng kumpipa puakin sawl hi: “Keima in Jerusalem le a mite theampo kumpipa ii sim laibu sia sungah a ki at bangin daan ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in kei hong nial a, tuaciang pathian dangte tungah sangaw biakpiakna pia zo hi, tua ahikom amate ii sep le vawt theampo in ka thin uukna piangsak hi. Ka thin uukna sia Jerusalem tungah tu hi, tuaciang tua ka thin uukna sia veng ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpipa ama a tu in hi bangin kei, Topa Israel ii Pathian in ci khi hi: nangma in laibu sung a ki at teng nadon zo ni hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuaciang Jerusalem le a mite daan piak tu ka tawn na te na zaak ciang kisiik kikin kiniamkhiakna taw ka mai ah na puansilh eaukeak in kap ni hi. Mit mu bek zongin a lauhuai mama na mun ka suaksak tu a, mihingte in tua mun ii min sia haamsiatna kammal in a zangh tu hi. Ahihang na thungetna hong za zo khi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuaciang Jerusalem khua daan ka piak tu sia zongh na thi zawk mateng in tung ngawl tu hi, thinnuam in kong thisak tu hi.” Tua pasalte in hi a thupuak teng taw kumpipa Josiah kungah heak kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa Josiah in Judah ngam le Jerusalem khua ii lampuite theampo khawmtua hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuaciang amate sia Biakinnpi ah thiampite le kamsaangte, tuaciang a taanglai mite theampo taw a hau a zawng kibangin paikhawm uh hi. Kumpipa in amate mai ah Biakinnpi sungah a kimu tua thuciamna laibu buppi a ngingin sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in kumpi khuam sia kungah dingin ama ii thu a ni tu, a thupiakte le a thukhamte thin theampo ngaisutna theampo taw a keamcing tu le thuciamna taw hong tangkal ngetnate zongh laibu sungah a ki at bangin a seam a vawt tu in Topa taw thuciamna khat vawt uh hi. Tuaciang mite theampo in thuciamna keamcing tu in kamciam pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Josiah in Thiampi Lianbel Hilkiah, a khutdawn thiampite, Biakinnpi tumna kongkhacingte munah, Biakinnpi sungah Baal biakna, numeipathian Asherah biakna le aksite biakna vanh theampo pusua siat tu in thupia hi. Kumpipa in hi vanh teng khuapi puasang Kidron kuam hui ah haltum in, a vaam teng sia Bethel ah paipuisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Judah khuapite le Jerusalem nai ah a om sangaw biakpiakna le doai sepna taute tungah a seam Judah kumpi masa te ii kipsak thiampite — Baal tung a sangaw biakpiakna a pia, ni, tha, solh le aksi te biakna ah a seam thiampi theampo heamkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Biakinnpi sung pan Asherah numeipathian ii lim sia la keakin khuapi pua sang Kidron kuam ah a haltum zawkciang a vaamte a zaancip dong sucip in nautaangte kiphumna munah poai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in pumpi zuakte teenna Biakinnpi sung inndoite baltham hi. (Numeite in tua munah Asherah biak natu a kizangh puantualte tak uh hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Judah khuapite a om thiampite Jerusalem ah paipui hi, tuaciang ngam bup sungah sangaw biakpiakna vawtna biaknataute phiat hi. Khuapi kongpi sung tum ciang veisang ah a om khuapi uk Joshua ii vawt keal-doai biakna biaknataute zongh baltham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua thiampite sia Biakinnpi sungah a sep tu ki oai ngawl hi, ahihang amate in a thiampi seppuite a kipia tol saw ngawl anluumte ne thei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kuama in a tapa ahibuale a tanu, Molech pathian tungah meihal biakpiakna in a nei thei ngawl natu in, Josiah kumpipa in Hinnom Kuam a om Topheth a kici doaibiakna mun sia zongh lalthamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in Judah kumpite ii ni biakna in a zak siphute heam a, hi biakpiakna sungah a kizangh leangte haltum hi. (Hite sia ulian mama khat ahi Nathan Melech ii teenna innte ii nai, biakinn leitual sung, kongpi hui ah kikoi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpipa Josiah in Ahaz kumpipa teenna inndoite ii tung kumpi innkhum tungah Judah kumpipate ii saksa biaknataute le Manasseh kumpipa ii Biakinnpi leitualte nii sungah a koi biaknataute vaattham hi; ama in biaknataute saatneen in a bek a bek in Kidron kuam ah vawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Josiah in Kumpipa Solomon ii saksa Jerusalem nisuana sang Olive Mual thang sangah a om a thasiathuai milim biaknataute — Sidon numeipathian Astarte, Moab pathian Chemosh, Ammon pathian Molech milim biaknate lalsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa Josiah in suangkhuamte vaattan in, Asherah numeipathian tepteena limte zongh sattan a, tuaciang tuate ii dinna mun sia mithi ngute taw siin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Josiah in Israel te mawna sungah a lampui Nebat ii tapa Kumpipa Jeroboam ii saksa Bethel a om biakpiakna mun sia zongh baltham hi. Josiah in biaknatau kaivawk a, a suangte a bekin sutham in leivui suak tu in seakcip hi; ama in Asherah ii lim zongh haltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Josiah in a kiimkot a et le mual tungah thaankuul pawlkhat mu hi; ama in mithi ngute la in biaknatau tungah halsak hi. Kumpipa Jeroboam sia poaikhaam sungin biaknatau hui ah a din laitak kamsaang khat ii nidang pek lai in a sonkhol sa bangin ama in vawt a, hi bangin biaknataute lalsak hi. Kumpipa Josiah in a kiimkot a et le tua bang a sonkhol kamsaangpa ii thaankuul mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in “Zia sia akua thaan ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Bethel mite in, “Tuasia Judah panin hong pai kamsaang khat ii thaan hi a, hi biaknatau tungah na vawt tu teng a sonkhol sia hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Josiah in, “A om bangin omsak po vun,” ci in thupia hi. “Ama ii ngute sia khiin tu hi ngawl hi,” ci hi. Tua ahikom a ngute sia kikhiin ngawl a, Samaria pan hong pai kamsaangte ii ngu zongh kikhiin ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa Josiah in Israel khuapi theampo ah Topa thin uukna piangsak Israel kumpite ii vawt doai biakna munte susia siat hi. Tua biaknataute Bethel a te a vawt bangin vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in doai bia thiampi theampo sia amate ii doai sepna biaknatau tungah thatlum a, tuaciang ama in biaknatau sim tungah mithi ngute hal hi. Tua zawkciang ama Jerusalem ah heak kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumpipa Josiah in mipite munah thuciam laibu sungah a ki at bangin Topa amate ii Pathian zatakna Paisan Poai vawtin sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi bang Paisan Poai khat Israel kumpipate ahibuale Judah kumpipate peuma in Thukhenmangte ii ngam a uk zawk nungsang in vawt ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu in a khakbel ciang Josiah ii kumpi maan zawk a kum sawm le liat na hun ciang Jerusalem khua sungah Paisan Poai kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thiampi Lianbel Hilkiah ii Biakinnpi sung pan a mu Thukham laibu sungah a ki at te bang ngamtatsak natu in Kumpipa Josiah in Jerusalem pan le Judah ngam lei dang panin, thaa sam thei te theampo, aisaan theite, bangkua pathiante, milimte, a dang doai sepna in a zak nate a vekpi in heam siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama ii Topa atu a thin theampo, a ngaisutna theampo le a thatang theampo taw seam a, Moses ii thukham theampo a zui bangin ama ii masia ah kumpi khat zongh om ngeingawl hi; ama zawkciang zong tuabang kumpi khat zongh om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahihang Topa ii a nasia mama a thin uukna sia Kumpipa Manasseh ii ngamtatna hangin Judah te tungah hong tung a, tu dong ma in thai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel tungah ka vawt sa bangma Judah tungah vawt tu khi hi: Judah mite sia ka muna pan hawlkhia tu khi hi, tuaciang ka tealsa Jerusalem khuapi le keima hong kibiakna mun tu hi ka ci Biakinnpi te zongh, ka nil tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpipa Josiah ii a sep a vawt dangte theampo sia Judah Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Josiah sia kumpi ahi laitakin, Egypt kumpipa Neco in Assyria kumpilianpa a hu tu in ngalkaphonpi taw Euphrates ngun ah kuan hi. Kumpipa Josiah in Megiddo ah Egypt ngalkaphonpi khak tu in hanciam a, ama ngal kisimna ah kithat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama ii uliante in a luang sia siphu leang tungah suan a Jerusalem ah ciapui in, kumpite thaan ah kiphum hi. Judah mite in Josiah ii tapa Joahaz tealin kumpi suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Joahaz sia Judah kumpi a sua hunin kum 23 pha hi, tuaciang ama in Jerusalem pan tha thum sung uk hi. A nu sia Hamutal hi a, Libnah khuapi pan Jeremiah ii tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A taanghpupite ii ngamtat zui in ama in Topa tungah maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama ii kumpi maan hun sia Egypt kumpipa Neco in Hamath ngam Riblah ah thong a taaksak ciang bo a, Judah in ngunn kilogramme 3,400 le khamh kilogramme 34 shia in piasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kumpipa Neco in Josiah ii tapa Eliakim sia Josiah laih tu Judah kumpipa in koi a, a min Jehoiakim ci in khealsak hi. Joahaz sia Kumpipa Neco in Egypt ah ciapui a, tuasung ah thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kumpipa Jehoiakim in a mipite tung pan amate hauna taw kizui in shia sia, Egypt kumpipa ii nget za a cingin a piak zawk natu in a kisamh bangin khon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jehoiakim sia Judah kumpipa a sua hunin ama kum 25 pha hi, tuaciang ama in Jerusalem panin kum sawm le kum khat sung uk hi. A nu sia Zebidah hi a, Rumah khua panin Pedaiah ii tanu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A taanghpupite ii ngamtat zui in ama in Topa tungah maw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehoiakim sia kumpipa ahi laitakin Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in Judah sim hi, tuaciang kum thum sung Jehoiakim sia ama ii ukna nuai ah lutsak hi; tua zawkciang ama in leedo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Babylon te, Syria te, Moab te le Ammon te ii ngalkapte ngalsim tu in Judah ah paisak a, Jehoiakim langpanin Topa in a naseam a kamsaangte tungtawnin ka vawt tu hi a ci bangin Judah lalsak tu in kuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hisia Topa ii thupiakna taw a piang hi a, Kumpipa Manasseh ii mawna teng hu in Judah mite sia ama muna pan a betkeak thei natu a piang ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuaciang, a tuan in mawnei ngawlte theampo zongh a thalup hu ahi hi. Topa in Manasseh ii tuabang ahikom in maisak zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoiakim ii sep le vawt theampo sia Judah Kumpipate Taanghthu sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jehoiakim thi a, a tapa Jehoiachin in a kumpi za laih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Egypt kumpipa le a ngalkaphonpi in Egypt pua sia ah kuan kik nawn ngawl uh hi, banghang ziam cile Babylon kumpipa in tu in Egypt te ii ngam theampo, Euphrates ngun pan Egypt saksang ngamngi dong uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoiachin sia Judah kumpipa a sua hunin kum sawm le kum liat pha a, ama in Jerusalem pan tha thum sung uk hi. A nu sia Nehushta hi a, Jerusalem khua pan Elnathan ii tanu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A pa ii ngamtat teng zui in Jehoiachin in Topa tungah maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama ii kumpi maan hun sungah Nebuchadnezzar uliante ii a uk Babylon ngalkaphonpi sia Jerusalem sim tu in kuan pui in, tua khuapi uumci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuabang a uumci sungin Nebuchadnezzar ama mama Jerusalem ah pai hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuaciang Kumpipa Jehoiachin sia a nu, a tapate, a uliante, le kumpi inn uliante taw Babylon te tungah tum uh hi. Nebuchadnezzar in a kumpi maan a kum liatna hun sungin Jehoiachin sia thong taak tu in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Babylon ah paipui a, Biakinnpi sung le kumpi inn sungah sum le vanh manpha theampo pua siat hi. Topa ii sonkhol bangma in Nebuchadnezzar in Biakinnpi sungah zak tu Solomon kumpipa ii vawt khamh ankuang ankeaute sutham siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar in Jerusalem mite, kumpipa tapate le lampuite theampo thongtaak tu in ciapui hi, a vekpi kingawm 10,000 pha hi. Ama in khutthiamna nei theampo, thikseakte zongh ciapui hi, Judah ah mizawngbel teng bek nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar in Jehoiachin sia Babylon ah thongtaak tu in ciapui a, Jehoiachin ii nu, a zite, a uliante le Judah mi lampuite theampo taw zong ciapui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar in mihing thupi theampo Babylon ah puak hi, a vekpi in 7,000 pha uh hi, tuaciang a ciapui thikseakte kihel, nasep thiamte 1,000 sia ngalkap seam thei tu cinghtengh vive ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nebuchadnezzar in Jehoiachin ii pano, Mattaniah sia Judah kumpipa suaksak a, a min Zedekiah ci in khealsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah kumpipa ii kumpipa a sua hunin Zedekiah sia kum 21 pha hi, tuaciang ama in Jerusalem pan kum sawm le kum khat sung uk hi. A nu sia Hamutal hi a, Libnah khua mi Jeremiah ii tanu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa Zedekiah in Topa tungah Kumpipa Jehoiakim maw bang tatakin maw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa sia Jerusalem le Judah mite tungah thin uuk mama ahikom ama muna pan bengkeak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zedekiah in Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar leedo ahikom Nebuchadnezzar in a ngalkap hon theampo taw Jerusalem sia Zedekiah ii kumpi maan a kum kua kum, a tha sawm, ni sawm ni in sim hi. Amate in khuapi pua sangah ngiaphual saat a, a uumci natu in pangte vawtin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zedekiah ii a ngam ukna, kum sawm le kum khat a cin dong uumci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua kum a tha lina, a ni sawm ni in, kialpi nasia mama a, mite neak tu bangma om nawn ngawl ahikom
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a mite in a khuapi luphung sulet hi. Babylon te in khuapi kiim uum ahihang ngalkap theampo sia zanin suakta uh hi. Amate in kumpi huan pan luphungte nii kipeena kongpi lam tawn in Jordan Kuam sangah tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang Babylon ngalkaphonpi in Zedekiah kumpipa zuizen a, Jericho khuahui zaangtamna munah man hi, ama sia a ngalkapte theampo in taisan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zedekiah sia Riblah ah a om Kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar kungah kipaipui a, tua mun ah Nebuchadnezzar in Zedekiah tungah thukhen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zedekiah ii mu tangin a tapate kithatlum hi; tua zawkciang Nebuchadnezzar in Zedekiah ii mittangte khelkeaksak a, thikkol bulin Babylon ah paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar ii kumpi maan kum sawm le kum kua kum, a tha nga na, a ni sali ni in kumpipa thudokpa le a ngalkaphonpi ukpa Nebuzaradan sia Jerusalem ah tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in Biakinnpi, kumpi inn le Jerusalem ah mihing thupi theampo ii innte haltham hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuaciang ama ii ngalkapte in khuapi luphungte pheltham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Nebuzaradan in khuapi sungah a kinusia mite, a om lai sun nasep thiamte le Babylon te panpui tu in a tai teng Babylon ah paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang ama in mizawngbel, neisa bangma a nei ngawl pawlkhat teng sia Judah ah nusia in sapithuan sung le lo sungah na seamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Babylon te in Biakinnpi sungah a om taau khuamte le leangte, tuaciang taau tuikuang lian sia semtham in taau om theampo Babylon ah paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in kawkeaute, biaknatau thiansakna a zak vut kuangte, meiinn detna vanh zakte, sangaw biakpiakna a sachi donna kuangte, ngimnamtui halna kuangte le a dang taau taw a kivawt biakinn sung na zakte zongh la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in khamh le ngunn taw a kivawt peuma, meikam toaina kuangtung kuangdal te dongin la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa Solomon ii Biakinnpi atu a vawt taau vanhte, — khuam niite, leangte, tuikuangpui — hite sia ngit leih ahikom khai kitee ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuampi nii a kiphutte sia kikim in metre 8 veu saang hi, a dawn a tungkhuna sia taau ma hi a, metre 1.3 saang hi. Tua khuamlu kiimkot simin taau taw a kivawt a tungkhu om a, tuate taau taw kivawt talee nga taw kizeam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuate ban ah, ngalkap maangpa Nebuzaradan in Thiampi Lianbel Seraiah le a dom thiampi Zephaniah le a dang biakinn a seam ulian thupi thum teng paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuapi sung panin ngalkap uk ulianpa, khuapi sung ma ah a om lai kumpipa ii aituam thudokte nga, ngalkap vai theampo tepteena keam ngalkap ukpa ii khutdawn pa le a dang mihing thupi 60 paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nebuzaradan in amate Hamath ngamsung Riblah khuapi ah om Babylon kumpipa kungah paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua munah kumpipa in amate velsak a, thatlumsak hi. Tua ahikom Judah mite sia amate ngam panin salin kipaipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in Shaphan ii tupa, Ahikam ii tapa Gedaliah sia Judah ngamuk mangpa in koi hi, tuaciang Babylon ah a kipaipui ngawlte uksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngalte khut sungah a tum ngawl Judean ngalkap maangte le ngalkapte in hi thu a zaak ciang Mizpah ah Gedaliah taw kikop uh hi. Hi ngalkap maangte sia Nethania ii tapa Ishmael, Kareah ii tapa Johanan, Netophah khua pan Tanhumeth ii tapa Seraiah le Maacah pan Jezaniah te ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gedaliah in amate tungah, “Babylon uliante kiitak om ngawl hi hong ci ngam khi hi. Hi ngam sungah teang vun a, Babylon kumpipa atu na na sepsak vun, tua hile na theampo a pha a dikin hong piang tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang tua kum sung a tha salina ciang, kumpi innkuan sung pan khat zongh ahi, Elishama ii tupa, Nethaniah ii tapa Ishmael sia Mizpah ah mihing sawm taw pai a, Gedaliah simin thatlum uh hi. Ama taw tualai ah a om Israel mite le Babylon te zongh that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Israel te theampo a hau a zawng, a kibangin ngalkap uliante taw tua mun nusia in Egypt ah tai uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate in Babylon te kiita uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Evilmerodach sia Babylon kumpipa a sua kumin, ama in Judah kumpipa Jehoiachin tungah hesuakna a lakna in thong panin pusuaksak hi. Hi bangin thu hong pian sia Jehoiachin ii luangtaak zawk a kum 37 na, tha sawm le tha nii, ni 27 ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Evilmerodach in ama sia hesuak a, ama taw Babylon ah sal tang khawm kumpi dangte sangin phat vawt zaw a, vaang neizaw dinmun pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuabangin Jehoiachin sia a thongpuante kilaihsak a, a nuntak sung teng kumpipa sabuai ah an kinesak hi.,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama ii a nuntak sung teng ni simin a taangsap bang a zak tu sum zongh a hun maan in kipia hi.
  </para>
</usx>
